WEBVTT

00:00.290 --> 00:00.910
<b><i>Shiki.</i></b>

00:01.710 --> 00:03.790
<b><i>Somewhere in this vast universe,</i></b>

00:04.250 --> 00:05.630
<b><i>Mother is to be found.</i></b>

00:05.830 --> 00:06.790
<b><i>Mother?</i></b>

00:07.040 --> 00:10.380
<b><i>A being capable of granting any wish.</i></b>

00:10.550 --> 00:12.800
<b><i>Even mine?</i></b>

00:13.550 --> 00:14.800
<b><i>What is your wish, Shiki?</i></b>

00:15.340 --> 00:17.800
<b><i>To make lots of friends!</i></b>

00:22.430 --> 00:26.230
<b>Master, why you are you 
looking outside, like that?</b>

00:26.600 --> 00:27.940
<b>Pino?</b>

00:28.820 --> 00:30.440
<b>Memories were coming back to me.</b>

00:30.610 --> 00:32.440
<b>-Memories? -Yes.</b>

00:32.740 --> 00:36.570
<b>Of everything that happened 
after I met Rebecca and Happy.</b>

00:36.990 --> 00:39.870
<b>I visited so many places, 
on board the Edens Zero.</b>

00:40.040 --> 00:43.580
<b>I met you all. It's making 
me a bit nostalgic.</b>

00:44.080 --> 00:48.540
<b>Then let's talk about the good 
old days with the others.</b>

00:48.710 --> 00:50.170
<b>Good idea.</b>

00:50.420 --> 00:51.500
<b>Where is Rebecca?</b>

00:51.670 --> 00:53.800
<b>She's putting a video together with Happy.</b>

00:53.970 --> 00:55.760
<b>For her Aoneko channel?</b>

00:55.930 --> 00:56.840
<b>What about Homura?</b>

00:57.010 --> 00:58.720
<b>She's in the Edens Zero bath.</b>

00:59.100 --> 01:00.010
<b>And Witch ?</b>

01:00.180 --> 01:03.520
<b>She's talking to Hermit, 
about the route to take.</b>

01:03.770 --> 01:04.640
<b>Sister?</b>

01:04.890 --> 01:06.560
<b>She's training Mosco.</b>

01:06.730 --> 01:07.650
<b>And Weisz?</b>

01:07.810 --> 01:10.360
<b>Weisz and Connor are resting.</b>

01:10.520 --> 01:11.730
<b>There's no one here!</b>

01:11.900 --> 01:14.440
<b>Then share your memories with me.</b>

01:15.110 --> 01:18.110
<b>Okay, so you'll stay with me, agreed?</b>

01:20.160 --> 01:21.990
<b><i>The Kingdom of Granbell.</i></b>

01:23.750 --> 01:24.660
<b><i>A man?</i></b>

01:27.330 --> 01:30.040
<b>You met Rebecca and Happy</b>

01:30.210 --> 01:32.800
<b>in the Kingdom of Granbell, right?</b>

01:32.960 --> 01:36.420
<b>Yes, I had never met a human before.</b>

01:36.680 --> 01:37.550
<b>What a shock!</b>

01:37.800 --> 01:40.890
<b>That's normal, seeing as you 
lived only with robots.</b>

01:41.050 --> 01:42.810
<b>Yes, but they went funny.</b>

01:42.970 --> 01:44.850
<b>I thought we were friends.</b>

01:45.020 --> 01:47.940
<b>They were infected by a virus. It's tough.</b>

01:48.270 --> 01:51.440
<b><i>We machines aren't tools for humans.</i></b>

01:51.690 --> 01:53.610
<b><i>We'll take our revenge on humans!</i></b>

01:53.940 --> 01:55.490
<b><i>Humans are our enemies.</i></b>

01:55.940 --> 01:57.450
<b><i>Humans are our enemies.</i></b>

01:57.780 --> 01:58.410
<b><i>Shiki!</i></b>

02:02.780 --> 02:03.580
<b><i>Stop.</i></b>

02:04.660 --> 02:07.040
<b><i>We're friends, right?</i></b>

02:07.620 --> 02:10.420
<b><i>Stop! This is so sad!</i></b>

02:16.880 --> 02:17.920
<b><i>Magimech Attack!</i></b>

02:20.180 --> 02:21.340
<b><i>Gravity Fist!</i></b>

02:21.510 --> 02:22.850
<b>MAGIMECH ATTACK GRAVITY FIST</b>

02:27.430 --> 02:28.480
<b><i>He's flying?</i></b>

02:28.640 --> 02:30.440
<b><i>It's the Gravity Ether Gear!</i></b>

02:30.770 --> 02:33.520
<b>Your Ether Gear is so powerful.</b>

02:33.820 --> 02:35.820
<b>I inherited it from my grandfather.</b>

02:35.980 --> 02:38.110
<b>The craziness of those robots</b>

02:38.450 --> 02:40.240
<b>and meeting Rebecca and Happy</b>

02:40.950 --> 02:44.330
<b>sent you off into space.</b>

02:44.490 --> 02:48.120
<b>Yes, I undertook that 
journey to make friends.</b>

02:49.080 --> 02:51.120
<b><i>So, this is space.</i></b>

02:52.580 --> 02:54.340
<b><i>They were my friends...</i></b>

02:56.590 --> 02:57.880
<b><i>Thank you!</i></b>

02:58.090 --> 02:59.170
<b><i>Thanks to you,</i></b>

02:59.380 --> 03:00.930
<b><i>I never felt alone.</i></b>

03:02.970 --> 03:04.680
<b><i>Unbelievable!</i></b>

03:05.100 --> 03:07.270
<b><i>It's full of giant buildings!</i></b>

03:07.930 --> 03:10.770
<b><i>Are you ready? The adventure is beginning.</i></b>

03:11.900 --> 03:14.270
<b><i>The adventure is beginning.</i></b>

03:14.810 --> 03:18.230
<b>Our first destination 
was Planet Blue Garden.</b>

03:18.740 --> 03:22.530
<b>That's home to the Shooting 
Starlight, the adventurers' guild.</b>

03:23.280 --> 03:26.330
<b>I was surprised by all the humans we saw.</b>

03:26.530 --> 03:29.160
<b>I thought I'd make friends with all of them.</b>

03:29.540 --> 03:31.580
<b>Number analysis: impossible.</b>

03:31.920 --> 03:35.460
<b><i>I want to be friends with 
all of these people.</i></b>

03:35.710 --> 03:37.880
<b><i>That's all the ill I'd wish upon you.</i></b>

03:38.340 --> 03:40.380
<b><i>But some are nice and some are nasty.</i></b>

03:40.550 --> 03:41.340
<b><i>Are you human?</i></b>

03:42.430 --> 03:43.220
<b><i>A guy, huh?</i></b>

03:43.390 --> 03:45.180
<b><i>Do you want to be my friend?</i></b>

03:45.550 --> 03:46.930
<b><i>Stop that!</i></b>

03:49.600 --> 03:50.310
<b><i>Hey!</i></b>

03:51.100 --> 03:52.190
<b><i>That's Mother!</i></b>

03:52.560 --> 03:53.440
<b><i>Mother ?</i></b>

03:54.020 --> 03:55.610
<b><i>I'd like to meet her.</i></b>

03:56.520 --> 03:57.320
<b><i>Hey.</i></b>

03:57.860 --> 04:02.740
<b><i>I get the impression that 
I've already met her.</i></b>

04:07.780 --> 04:09.540
<b><i>Rebecca!</i></b>

04:09.870 --> 04:10.870
<b><i>Happy!</i></b>

04:11.290 --> 04:13.670
<b><i>That's a cat from Planet Excede, huh?</i></b>

04:13.830 --> 04:16.170
<b><i>For me? I'll make good use of it.</i></b>

04:16.540 --> 04:17.710
<b><i>See you later!</i></b>

04:17.880 --> 04:19.340
<b><i>Rebecca!</i></b>

04:19.500 --> 04:20.550
<b><i>Happy!</i></b>

04:20.710 --> 04:23.050
<b><i>Friend thief!</i></b>

04:23.510 --> 04:24.760
<b><i>You'll see!</i></b>

04:25.260 --> 04:27.720
<b>That's when Happy was stolen!</b>

04:28.300 --> 04:31.810
<b>I was so shocked when I saw 
him turn into a pistol.</b>

04:31.980 --> 04:34.390
<b>You didn't stop being surprised.</b>

04:34.850 --> 04:36.770
<b>Space is so crazy!</b>

04:38.400 --> 04:39.440
<b><i>Rats...</i></b>

04:40.150 --> 04:42.280
<b><i>You dared to steal Happy from me!</i></b>

04:43.110 --> 04:45.860
<b><i>Get a load of this!</i></b>

04:47.410 --> 04:51.200
<b>Happy turned into a robot, 
due to a tragedy, I think.</b>

04:51.370 --> 04:55.080
<b>She has a powerful bond to Rebecca.</b>

04:55.830 --> 04:57.630
<b><i>What's your name?</i></b>

04:57.790 --> 04:59.040
<b><i>I don't have a name.</i></b>

04:59.210 --> 05:01.130
<b><i>Then I'll give you one.</i></b>

05:01.460 --> 05:05.260
<b><i>You're my new friend and 
that makes me happy.</i></b>

05:05.430 --> 05:07.510
<b><i>So I'll call you Happy!</i></b>

05:07.760 --> 05:09.050
<b><i>Happy!</i></b>

05:16.850 --> 05:18.770
<b><i>Happy...</i></b>

05:21.270 --> 05:22.440
<b><i>Why?</i></b>

05:23.150 --> 05:26.030
<b><i>We were supposed to be together forever.</i></b>

05:29.660 --> 05:33.580
<b><i>I've turned into a machine, Rebecca...</i></b>

05:36.460 --> 05:37.330
<b><i>I...</i></b>

05:39.420 --> 05:40.920
<b><i>Happy!</i></b>

05:42.590 --> 05:45.260
<b><i>Did I scare you?</i></b>

05:45.720 --> 05:48.840
<b><i>I don't care. We'll always be together.</i></b>

05:49.390 --> 05:50.760
<b><i>Because you're my friend!</i></b>

05:57.440 --> 06:00.810
<b><i>Who have we here? Rebecca, 
the second zone B-Cuber,</i></b>

06:01.310 --> 06:04.360
<b><i>with Hoppy, her stunted little cat.</i></b>

06:04.530 --> 06:05.570
<b><i>Laviria...</i></b>

06:05.740 --> 06:07.820
<b><i>My name's not Hoppy!</i></b>

06:08.530 --> 06:10.740
<b><i>-It's Laviria! -In person!</i></b>

06:10.910 --> 06:13.370
<b><i>Your latest videos weren't great.</i></b>

06:13.740 --> 06:14.910
<b><i>Who asked you?</i></b>

06:15.540 --> 06:16.620
<b><i>Who is she?</i></b>

06:16.960 --> 06:20.170
<b><i>I'm a really famous B-Cuber.</i></b>

06:20.830 --> 06:25.550
<b><i>Everyone in the Sakura Cosmos knows me.</i></b>

06:25.710 --> 06:27.090
<b><i>Well, I don't.</i></b>

06:29.630 --> 06:33.010
<b><i>That doesn't matter. You're a 
friend of Rebecca's after all.</i></b>

06:33.430 --> 06:34.680
<b><i>You're a hick.</i></b>

06:35.060 --> 06:36.850
<b><i>All the best, little lady.</i></b>

06:37.020 --> 06:39.640
<b><i>Carry on making loads of lame videos.</i></b>

06:40.480 --> 06:42.480
<b><i>She's getting on my nerves!</i></b>

06:42.860 --> 06:44.070
<b><i>Sign this, Laviria.</i></b>

06:44.270 --> 06:45.900
<b>Laviria is a B-Cuber,</b>

06:46.230 --> 06:50.780
<b>with a lot more followers than Rebecca.</b>

06:51.070 --> 06:54.780
<b>I'd never look down on anyone, 
because I have more friends.</b>

06:55.330 --> 06:58.790
<b><i>I could make a better video than hers.</i></b>

07:01.460 --> 07:03.210
<b><i>Let's go to meet Mother!</i></b>

07:07.130 --> 07:09.590
<b><i>No one's ever seen her, right?</i></b>

07:09.760 --> 07:11.300
<b><i>Then let's be the first.</i></b>

07:12.140 --> 07:15.600
<b><i>We'll ask her to turn our 
wishes into a video.</i></b>

07:16.140 --> 07:18.480
<b><i>Going to meet Mother...</i></b>

07:19.890 --> 07:21.270
<b><i>We can film this!</i></b>

07:21.440 --> 07:22.940
<b><i>Yes!</i></b>

07:23.270 --> 07:25.650
<b><i>There's not a minute to lose! Let's go!</i></b>

07:26.150 --> 07:29.360
<b>You're registered with the guild</b>

07:29.530 --> 07:31.780
<b>and you've set your objective.</b>

07:31.950 --> 07:34.530
<b>Yes, to meet Mother.</b>

07:34.700 --> 07:36.490
<b>Our adventure has begun.</b>

07:36.740 --> 07:39.290
<b>You needed a ship,</b>

07:39.620 --> 07:41.920
<b>so you went to Norma.</b>

07:42.080 --> 07:44.460
<b>Yes, we went to ask for advice</b>

07:44.750 --> 07:46.590
<b>from Dr. Weisz,</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:50.510
<b>an old friend of Rebecca's, 
who saved Happy, but...</b>

08:04.350 --> 08:05.270
<b><i>Norma...</i></b>

08:06.060 --> 08:07.150
<b><i>That planet...</i></b>

08:09.030 --> 08:10.400
<b><i>is already dead.</i></b>

08:11.110 --> 08:14.700
<b>That's when we found out that 
Norma was already dead.</b>

08:14.860 --> 08:16.950
<b>With its big underground city,</b>

08:17.120 --> 08:18.950
<b>it didn't get any air.</b>

08:19.330 --> 08:22.500
<b>When we went to Dr. Weisz...</b>

08:22.660 --> 08:23.710
<b><i>Don't move!</i></b>

08:25.040 --> 08:25.630
<b><i>Who's that?</i></b>

08:27.130 --> 08:28.960
<b><i>I'd ask you the same question.</i></b>

08:29.590 --> 08:31.630
<b><i>What are you doing in my place?</i></b>

08:32.380 --> 08:33.680
<b><i>Your place?</i></b>

08:33.840 --> 08:36.760
<b><i>Sorry, but this is Dr. Weisz's house.</i></b>

08:39.260 --> 08:41.430
<b><i>I am Weisz Steiner.</i></b>

08:42.060 --> 08:43.770
<b><i>Who are you?</i></b>

08:44.230 --> 08:45.850
<b>The Dr. Weisz that we met</b>

08:46.020 --> 08:48.570
<b>was younger than the one that Rebecca knew.</b>

08:48.730 --> 08:51.820
<b>And he didn't know her. 
It was incomprehensible.</b>

08:56.280 --> 08:56.780
<b><i>Found!</i></b>

08:57.660 --> 08:58.910
<b><i>Magimech Attack!</i></b>

08:59.780 --> 09:00.830
<b><i>Gravity Fist!</i></b>

09:02.080 --> 09:03.790
<b>MAGIMECH ATTACK GRAVITY FIST</b>

09:04.290 --> 09:07.130
<b>Even more disturbingly,</b>

09:07.290 --> 09:11.300
<b>we found out that that was 
Norma, 50 years earlier.</b>

09:11.630 --> 09:14.550
<b><i>That's Norma, the way it was 50 years ago.</i></b>

09:15.430 --> 09:18.390
<b><i>Have we made a time leap?</i></b>

09:18.930 --> 09:22.890
<b><i>But then the Weisz that we met earlier...</i></b>

09:23.680 --> 09:24.850
<b><i>That was Dr. Weisz,</i></b>

09:26.350 --> 09:27.480
<b><i>when he was young.</i></b>

09:28.270 --> 09:31.820
<b>And Weisz stole a case from 
Sibir's gang of thieves.</b>

09:31.980 --> 09:35.360
<b>That case was going to have a major impact</b>

09:35.530 --> 09:38.200
<b>on what happened next in 
our adventures, Master.</b>

09:38.370 --> 09:40.330
<b>Pino, you're bigging yourself up a bit.</b>

09:47.040 --> 09:50.920
<b><i>You're not making things 
that easy for me, Master.</i></b>

09:53.000 --> 09:55.220
<b><i>What is this?</i></b>

09:55.510 --> 09:56.260
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

09:57.050 --> 09:59.390
<b><i>I can't see my master anywhere.</i></b>

09:59.930 --> 10:03.100
<b><i>I'm an anti-bot machine.</i></b>

10:03.560 --> 10:05.680
<b><i>My name is E.M. Pino.</i></b>

10:07.350 --> 10:09.150
<b><i>You can call me Pino.</i></b>

10:10.980 --> 10:12.570
<b><i>-What? -A power cut.</i></b>

10:13.270 --> 10:17.110
<b><i>Sorry, that's my EMP.</i></b>

10:17.360 --> 10:19.780
<b><i>-EMP? -Electromagnetic pulse.</i></b>

10:20.030 --> 10:22.530
<b>That's where I met you, Master.</b>

10:22.700 --> 10:23.240
<b>Yes!</b>

10:23.620 --> 10:27.040
<b>But we had scarcely become friends 
when you went back to Sibir.</b>

10:27.210 --> 10:29.420
<b>I didn't understand.</b>

10:29.580 --> 10:31.460
<b>It wasn't my fault.</b>

10:31.750 --> 10:33.090
<b>Yes, I know.</b>

10:33.380 --> 10:35.710
<b>That's why I went to rescue you.</b>

10:36.090 --> 10:36.970
<b><i>Wow...</i></b>

10:37.670 --> 10:39.840
<b><i>Do you want to be my friend?</i></b>

10:40.010 --> 10:43.050
<b><i>You don't miss a trick.</i></b>

10:43.560 --> 10:44.850
<b><i>Friend...</i></b>

10:45.520 --> 10:46.600
<b><i>Request accepted.</i></b>

10:46.770 --> 10:47.680
<b><i>So cool!</i></b>

10:47.850 --> 10:49.520
<b><i>So they became friends.</i></b>

10:50.060 --> 10:51.270
<b><i>I'm putting you...</i></b>

10:52.310 --> 10:53.020
<b><i>on pause.</i></b>

10:53.190 --> 10:55.070
<b><i>I don't want to be your friend!</i></b>

10:55.690 --> 10:58.190
<b><i>I'm scared of going up against Sibir.</i></b>

10:58.530 --> 10:59.780
<b><i>Check planning!</i></b>

11:00.490 --> 11:01.110
<b><i>Wait.</i></b>

11:01.570 --> 11:03.660
<b><i>Moving toward objective activated.</i></b>

11:07.000 --> 11:10.670
<b>I say I want to see the metal doll dance.</b>

11:10.830 --> 11:12.080
<b>Stop!</b>

11:12.790 --> 11:16.130
<b>If you don't know how to dance, 
then you won't miss this leg.</b>

11:19.920 --> 11:22.180
<b><i>I want to go home...</i></b>

11:23.390 --> 11:25.100
<b><i>to my master.</i></b>

11:25.430 --> 11:26.970
<b><i>I'll help you!</i></b>

11:27.390 --> 11:28.980
<b><i>We have to do something.</i></b>

11:30.440 --> 11:31.230
<b><i>Hold on...</i></b>

11:32.150 --> 11:32.900
<b><i>Pino.</i></b>

11:40.780 --> 11:42.660
<b><i>Weisz, damn you!</i></b>

11:43.030 --> 11:44.450
<b><i>I recognize you.</i></b>

11:45.160 --> 11:49.080
<b><i>Sorry, but I don't tend to give 
back the things I've stolen.</i></b>

11:49.870 --> 11:52.830
<b><i>Damn kids...</i></b>

11:56.670 --> 11:57.670
<b><i>Them again?</i></b>

11:58.420 --> 12:00.010
<b><i>Let Pino go!</i></b>

12:02.630 --> 12:04.050
<b><i>-Shiki! -Yes!</i></b>

12:06.930 --> 12:08.260
<b><i>Kill them!</i></b>

12:11.390 --> 12:12.480
<b><i>Magimech Attack.</i></b>

12:12.850 --> 12:14.900
<b><i>Gravity Wave!</i></b>

12:16.610 --> 12:19.070
<b>MAGIMECH ATTACK GRAVITY WAVE</b>

12:19.530 --> 12:23.150
<b>Weisz also came to your 
rescue. He's a good guy.</b>

12:23.490 --> 12:27.700
<b>It'd be more accurate to say 
that he came to steal me back.</b>

12:30.750 --> 12:32.500
<b><i>A new Knight Gear?</i></b>

12:43.510 --> 12:44.840
<b><i>Shiki!</i></b>

12:45.840 --> 12:47.800
<b><i>Damn kid.</i></b>

12:48.220 --> 12:51.810
<b><i>No one annoyed me like that in a long time.</i></b>

12:52.430 --> 12:53.770
<b><i>That's exactly</i></b>

12:54.230 --> 12:57.110
<b><i>what I was going to say to you!</i></b>

13:01.230 --> 13:03.360
<b><i>The machines are alive.</i></b>

13:10.910 --> 13:13.500
<b><i>They have a heart!</i></b>

13:17.790 --> 13:19.420
<b><i>Magimech Attack.</i></b>

13:19.880 --> 13:22.510
<b><i>Gravity Munition.</i></b>

13:32.270 --> 13:33.680
<b>MAGIMIECH ATTACK GRAVITY MUNITION</b>

13:37.350 --> 13:39.440
<b>They treated me like scrap metal,</b>

13:39.610 --> 13:42.610
<b>but you taught me something important.</b>

13:43.360 --> 13:44.490
<b>I was so happy</b>

13:44.650 --> 13:47.860
<b>to be told that I was alive, 
that I had a heart.</b>

13:48.030 --> 13:51.620
<b>Seeing as I grew up on Granbell, 
it seemed obvious to me.</b>

13:51.830 --> 13:55.370
<b>Then it became clear I was 
a machine from your time</b>

13:56.000 --> 13:58.330
<b>and I joined your crew.</b>

13:58.500 --> 14:01.920
<b>Yes, that's when your adventure began.</b>

14:02.210 --> 14:02.960
<b>Yes.</b>

14:03.210 --> 14:06.170
<b><i>And didn't they do anything to you?</i></b>

14:07.680 --> 14:10.430
<b><i>Are you more worried about 
a machine than yourself?</i></b>

14:11.140 --> 14:12.720
<b><i>You're not a machine.</i></b>

14:13.640 --> 14:14.890
<b><i>You're my friend, right?</i></b>

14:21.860 --> 14:22.690
<b><i>Yes.</i></b>

14:25.280 --> 14:27.070
<b><i>This is really disappointing.</i></b>

14:27.700 --> 14:28.740
<b><i>Dr. Weisz!</i></b>

14:29.450 --> 14:34.160
<b>I wondered what Weisz was doing in the ship.</b>

14:34.950 --> 14:36.330
<b><i>What are you doing here?</i></b>

14:36.710 --> 14:38.620
<b><i>I needed some, to get away.</i></b>

14:38.790 --> 14:40.210
<b><i>You wanted to steal it?</i></b>

14:41.630 --> 14:43.420
<b><i>Give it to me.</i></b>

14:43.880 --> 14:45.920
<b><i>In exchange, I'll take you into space.</i></b>

14:46.130 --> 14:49.930
<b>Thanks to his Ether Gear,</b>

14:50.090 --> 14:52.220
<b>we managed to escape from Norma.</b>

14:52.550 --> 14:53.720
<b>I remember!</b>

14:53.890 --> 14:56.430
<b>He piloted and improved the 
ship at the same time.</b>

14:57.060 --> 14:58.140
<b>I couldn't believe it.</b>

14:58.310 --> 15:00.650
<b>That man is amazing.</b>

15:01.020 --> 15:03.570
<b><i>It's incredible. The ship...</i></b>

15:04.190 --> 15:08.030
<b><i>He can modify the ship, in real time.</i></b>

15:10.200 --> 15:11.660
<b><i>Ether Jet Online!</i></b>

15:16.540 --> 15:20.210
<b>That's when we got a call 
from the older Weisz.</b>

15:20.500 --> 15:23.130
<b>At first, we thought it was his grandfather.</b>

15:23.500 --> 15:25.960
<b>The 50-year-older Dr. Weisz told us</b>

15:26.130 --> 15:30.050
<b>that the Chronophage had stolen 50 years</b>

15:30.220 --> 15:31.930
<b>from Planet Norma.</b>

15:32.260 --> 15:35.220
<b><i>You're talking to us, but 
you're in the future.</i></b>

15:35.850 --> 15:38.480
<b><i>It's not the future, it's the present.</i></b>

15:38.680 --> 15:41.230
<b><i>You came out of the past.</i></b>

15:41.640 --> 15:43.230
<b><i>When?</i></b>

15:43.400 --> 15:46.780
<b><i>You were only there for your time on Norma.</i></b>

15:47.440 --> 15:50.610
<b><i>Time recedes on the planets 
that the Chronophage devours</i></b>

15:51.070 --> 15:52.910
<b><i>And it's irreversible.</i></b>

15:53.070 --> 15:57.240
<b><i>The Norma in our reality is 50 years old.</i></b>

15:57.620 --> 16:00.660
<b><i>The Chronophage thus creates 
two parallel histories</i></b>

16:00.830 --> 16:02.250
<b><i>and upends the cosmos.</i></b>

16:03.080 --> 16:04.420
<b><i>What's that...</i></b>

16:06.380 --> 16:08.460
<b><i>that vast ship?</i></b>

16:08.630 --> 16:13.130
<b>That's when we were eaten 
up by a gigantic ship.</b>

16:13.300 --> 16:16.510
<b>It belonged to Elsie Crimson, 
the famous space pirate.</b>

16:16.680 --> 16:18.890
<b>It's called the Skull Fairy.</b>

16:19.060 --> 16:23.350
<b>We can just steal that pirate 
ship and it'll be ours!</b>

16:23.520 --> 16:27.650
<b>Your optimism goes beyond my 
analytical capacity, master.</b>

16:28.270 --> 16:31.950
<b><i>That's good. We needed a big ship.</i></b>

16:33.070 --> 16:33.950
<b><i>We're lucky!</i></b>

16:35.490 --> 16:36.450
<b><i>Looks promising.</i></b>

16:36.950 --> 16:40.620
<b><i>I'm two floors above, at the end 
of the corridor, to the left.</i></b>

16:40.910 --> 16:42.660
<b><i>You can try to get close.</i></b>

16:54.630 --> 16:57.760
<b><i>The cosmos is so cool!</i></b>

16:58.810 --> 16:59.890
<b><i>Hey, Redhead!</i></b>

17:03.060 --> 17:05.730
<b><i>My name is Elsie Crimson...</i></b>

17:14.820 --> 17:16.870
<b><i>Who are you really, Shiki?</i></b>

17:18.030 --> 17:19.530
<b><i>I'm an adventurer.</i></b>

17:19.990 --> 17:21.620
<b><i>What is your goal?</i></b>

17:22.700 --> 17:24.250
<b><i>I want to meet Mother!</i></b>

17:24.540 --> 17:28.960
<b><i>Countless have tried and never come back.</i></b>

17:29.290 --> 17:31.000
<b><i>Who dares wins!</i></b>

17:31.170 --> 17:32.260
<b><i>No way!</i></b>

17:32.760 --> 17:33.840
<b><i>We...</i></b>

17:37.720 --> 17:38.930
<b><i>can do it!</i></b>

17:45.730 --> 17:47.020
<b><i>Magimech Attack!</i></b>

17:47.650 --> 17:49.770
<b><i>Gravity Comet!</i></b>

17:50.820 --> 17:52.900
<b>Elsie was really strong,</b>

17:53.360 --> 17:54.740
<b>but we got out,</b>

17:54.900 --> 17:58.160
<b>thanks to a technique 
taught by my grandfather.</b>

17:58.780 --> 18:02.080
<b>In reality, it was a parasite, 
impersonating Elsie,</b>

18:02.240 --> 18:03.410
<b>the Niteru S4.</b>

18:03.580 --> 18:05.580
<b>We got the ship</b>

18:05.750 --> 18:07.460
<b>and Elsie let us go.</b>

18:07.620 --> 18:09.420
<b>She's a good person.</b>

18:09.710 --> 18:13.880
<b>I was always planning on 
giving you the ship, Shiki.</b>

18:14.380 --> 18:17.010
<b>He belonged to Ziggy, the Demon King.</b>

18:18.390 --> 18:21.600
<b>He used that ship to try to find Mother</b>

18:21.930 --> 18:24.020
<b>and got out of the Sakura Cosmos.</b>

18:24.560 --> 18:26.100
<b>I found out</b>

18:26.560 --> 18:29.850
<b>that my old master was 
Ziggy, the Demon King.</b>

18:30.360 --> 18:33.440
<b><i>So my master is no more...</i></b>

18:33.730 --> 18:36.440
<b>I was in debt to Ziggy.</b>

18:37.610 --> 18:40.240
<b>He asked me to give you this ship,</b>

18:40.410 --> 18:44.620
<b>on the day you went into space.</b>

18:51.380 --> 18:52.130
<b><i>Princess!</i></b>

18:52.340 --> 18:54.340
<b><i>Calm down. It's just intimidation.</i></b>

18:57.300 --> 19:00.180
<b><i>-What is it this time? 
-The Interstellar Army.</i></b>

19:01.010 --> 19:03.180
<b><i>Leave, as quickly as possible.</i></b>

19:03.810 --> 19:06.430
<b>So, you were a friend of 
my grandfather's, huh?</b>

19:07.730 --> 19:09.640
<b><i>Then you are my friend too.</i></b>

19:10.190 --> 19:13.570
<b>Yes, Ziggy, told me that.</b>

19:14.730 --> 19:18.820
<b><i>People that find Mother 
experience a rebirth.</i></b>

19:20.570 --> 19:23.320
<b>And after finishing the 
clean-up, in the ship...</b>

19:24.200 --> 19:26.750
<b><i>What a pleasure to see 
you again, Demon King.</i></b>

19:27.120 --> 19:30.080
<b><i>I'm in charge of the ship's management.</i></b>

19:30.460 --> 19:34.460
<b><i>I am Witch, one of the Demon 
King's Four Shining Stars.</i></b>

19:35.170 --> 19:39.050
<b>Witch, one of the Four Shining 
Stars and the Shield of Edens.</b>

19:39.380 --> 19:40.300
<b><i>Activation!</i></b>

19:41.010 --> 19:44.850
<b>That's how we got to know the ship.</b>

19:45.390 --> 19:46.100
<b>Yes.</b>

19:46.310 --> 19:48.890
<b><i>It crossed the Cosmos, with 
its pearly black wings.</i></b>

19:51.310 --> 19:54.610
<b><i>Ether Drive Eternal Navigation Ship.</i></b>

19:56.440 --> 19:57.940
<b>The space battleship!</b>

19:58.400 --> 19:59.820
<b>Edens Zero!</b>

20:05.120 --> 20:08.330
<b><i>Let us salute the return 
of the king of Edens Zero.</i></b>

20:09.040 --> 20:12.960
<b><i>I have the power to control 
and manage Edens Zero.</i></b>

20:13.460 --> 20:15.790
<b><i>I am an integral part of the ship.</i></b>

20:16.670 --> 20:19.460
<b><i>There are three other Shining Stars.</i></b>

20:20.090 --> 20:23.590
<b><i>Let's come together and the ship 
will regain its true power.</i></b>

20:24.090 --> 20:25.470
<b><i>But without them,</i></b>

20:26.050 --> 20:28.810
<b><i>it will be extremely hard 
to get past Dragonfall,</i></b>

20:29.310 --> 20:32.190
<b><i>the border between the Sakura 
Cosmos and outer space.</i></b>

20:32.640 --> 20:36.860
<b>We urgently needed to reunite 
the other three Shining Stars.</b>

20:37.020 --> 20:40.530
<b>It's like a collector, completing a series.</b>

20:40.690 --> 20:43.070
<b>It was necessary, to get 
out of the Sakura Cosmos</b>

20:43.240 --> 20:44.910
<b>and to look for Mother!</b>

20:45.240 --> 20:46.740
<b><i>Okay, so long!</i></b>

20:47.580 --> 20:50.580
<b><i>I want to make the most of the future. Bye!</i></b>

20:51.160 --> 20:54.920
<b>We went back to Blue Garden, 
to gather information.</b>

20:55.710 --> 20:57.880
<b>But that was a series of challenges.</b>

20:58.590 --> 21:00.420
<b>Labilia showed up again.</b>

21:01.170 --> 21:04.090
<b><i>My mission is to bring you back.</i></b>

21:04.300 --> 21:05.180
<b><i>Stop!</i></b>

21:05.340 --> 21:07.720
<b><i>Help!</i></b>

21:08.600 --> 21:09.640
<b><i>Just a moment.</i></b>

21:12.390 --> 21:14.480
<b><i>His arm!</i></b>

21:19.650 --> 21:21.280
<b><i>Is that a machine?</i></b>

21:21.780 --> 21:22.780
<b><i>Analysis in process.</i></b>

21:23.070 --> 21:25.320
<b><i>Body 60% mechanized.</i></b>

21:25.950 --> 21:27.160
<b><i>It's a cyborg.</i></b>

21:28.620 --> 21:30.240
<b><i>I'll eliminate the problem.</i></b>

21:30.580 --> 21:31.450
<b><i>From Ether Gear?</i></b>

21:32.120 --> 21:34.370
<b><i>No one without a heart will defeat me.</i></b>

21:35.170 --> 21:36.750
<b><i>You're using Ether Gear too.</i></b>

21:36.920 --> 21:39.460
<b>Laviria wasn't the only one to show up.</b>

21:40.380 --> 21:44.420
<b>Yes, this guy is really 
good. Ninja are powerful!</b>

21:45.010 --> 21:46.590
<b><i>Skymech Ninjutsu Attack.</i></b>

21:46.970 --> 21:47.970
<b><i>Ninjutsu?</i></b>

21:48.140 --> 21:50.010
<b><i>Windstorm Slash!</i></b>

21:51.970 --> 21:52.890
<b>SKYMECH NINJUTSU ATTACK WINDSTORM SLASH</b>

21:56.270 --> 21:58.360
<b><i>That ninja's good!</i></b>

21:58.860 --> 22:01.690
<b><i>If you want to fight, come to Guilst.</i></b>

22:02.440 --> 22:03.490
<b><i>Guilst?</i></b>

22:04.150 --> 22:05.780
<b><i>We'll finish this duel</i></b>

22:06.280 --> 22:08.490
<b><i>when the wind blows.</i></b>

22:09.910 --> 22:13.500
<b>Then the master of the 
guild called in Rebecca.</b>

22:16.370 --> 22:17.080
<b><i>Happy!</i></b>

22:17.920 --> 22:20.000
<b><i>What happened?</i></b>

22:20.920 --> 22:22.750
<b><i>At the master's place,</i></b>

22:23.000 --> 22:25.420
<b><i>this strange person attacked us.</i></b>

22:27.050 --> 22:31.140
<b><i>When I regained consciousness, 
Rebecca and the master had gone.</i></b>

22:31.300 --> 22:32.470
<b><i>What could we do?</i></b>

22:32.850 --> 22:33.810
<b><i>What?</i></b>

22:34.720 --> 22:36.270
<b>Eternal City on Blue Garden</b>

22:36.430 --> 22:39.770
<b>was the site of successive 
kidnappings of B-Cubers.</b>

22:41.230 --> 22:42.770
<b><i>We're going back to Edens Zero!</i></b>

22:43.730 --> 22:44.360
<b><i>Yes!</i></b>

22:45.990 --> 22:50.570
<b>We went to Guilst, which Jinn 
mentioned, to save her.</b>

22:53.200 --> 22:55.250
<b><i>Edens Zero...</i></b>

22:55.910 --> 22:58.120
<b><i>Can Happy be repaired?</i></b>

22:58.870 --> 23:03.290
<b><i>He can be saved, but that's 
beyond my skillset.</i></b>

23:04.670 --> 23:08.840
<b><i>If only Sister, Life of Edens, was here.</i></b>

23:09.430 --> 23:11.300
<b><i>Life of Edens?</i></b>

23:11.760 --> 23:15.310
<b><i>She has the power to tend to all wounds.</i></b>

23:15.890 --> 23:19.940
<b><i>Her work was to repair machines.</i></b>

23:21.020 --> 23:23.230
<b><i>And I am the Shield of Edens.</i></b>

23:23.570 --> 23:25.570
<b><i>My job is to protect the ship.</i></b>

23:25.940 --> 23:29.820
<b><i>Then there's Valkyrie, Sword of Edens,</i></b>

23:30.280 --> 23:32.910
<b><i>and Hermit, Mind of Edens.</i></b>

23:33.240 --> 23:36.910
<b><i>Guilst is among Sakura Cosmos's 
most dangerous planets.</i></b>

23:37.750 --> 23:41.370
<b><i>You won't save Rebecca unless 
you go in there hard.</i></b>

23:41.620 --> 23:44.590
<b><i>I'll save her. She's my friend!</i></b>

23:44.750 --> 23:47.090
<b><i>Keep a cool head.</i></b>

23:49.300 --> 23:50.260
<b><i>Weisz?</i></b>

23:51.130 --> 23:51.930
<b><i>And...</i></b>

23:53.220 --> 23:54.050
<b><i>Who's this?</i></b>

23:54.890 --> 23:57.680
<b><i>My name is Homura. I am not your enemy.</i></b>

23:58.480 --> 24:02.100
<b>And just before we left, Weisz 
brought us a mysterious girl.</b>

24:02.440 --> 24:03.270
<b>Yes, Homura.</b>

24:03.690 --> 24:06.480
<b>Wait, you're spoiling my effects.</b>

24:06.650 --> 24:08.820
<b>In exchange for a place on board,</b>

24:08.990 --> 24:11.910
<b>she promised to help us to save Rebecca.</b>

24:12.360 --> 24:15.240
<b><i>I want to help you to help your companions.</i></b>

24:15.910 --> 24:20.160
<b><i>It's a dangerous planet. Better 
to have a few people onside.</i></b>

24:20.330 --> 24:22.670
<b><i>She wants to help, but how?</i></b>

24:28.510 --> 24:30.470
<b><i>With powers I've had since childhood.</i></b>

24:31.130 --> 24:32.880
<b><i>Ether Gear!</i></b>

24:33.720 --> 24:34.340
<b><i>Seriously?</i></b>

24:34.760 --> 24:36.850
<b>It felt good to have her with us.</b>

24:37.260 --> 24:41.560
<b>Weisz couldn't stop looking 
at her, from head to toe.</b>

24:55.240 --> 24:57.240
<b><i>This is my new armchair.</i></b>

24:57.410 --> 25:00.580
<b><i>You'll also soon be part of my collection.</i></b>

25:00.750 --> 25:01.870
<b><i>Stop!</i></b>

25:02.250 --> 25:03.330
<b><i>Help!</i></b>

25:08.750 --> 25:09.880
<b><i>No one...</i></b>

25:11.460 --> 25:13.380
<b><i>What's this big statue?</i></b>

25:15.970 --> 25:19.350
<b><i>What brings you here?</i></b>

25:20.140 --> 25:21.470
<b>We managed to infiltrate</b>

25:21.640 --> 25:23.770
<b>the Rogue Out, who kidnapped Rebecca,</b>

25:24.100 --> 25:25.940
<b>but we came across...</b>

25:26.400 --> 25:27.480
<b><i>Who are you?</i></b>

25:30.230 --> 25:32.280
<b><i>I am Sister,</i></b>

25:32.780 --> 25:34.610
<b><i>leader of the Rogue Out.</i></b>

25:35.280 --> 25:36.490
<b><i>Sister?</i></b>

25:37.320 --> 25:39.410
<b><i>One of the Four Shining Stars?</i></b>

25:41.790 --> 25:46.170
<b>Why was one of the Four Shining Stars 
involved in people trafficking?</b>

25:46.460 --> 25:49.290
<b>We found out later.</b>

25:49.750 --> 25:51.000
<b><i>Now then,</i></b>

25:51.170 --> 25:54.260
<b><i>another clan that opposes us.</i></b>

25:54.420 --> 25:57.180
<b><i>Make sure their bodies are properly kept.</i></b>

25:57.390 --> 25:58.010
<b><i>Good!</i></b>

25:59.350 --> 26:02.850
<b><i>I'll turn them into good soldiers.</i></b>

26:03.060 --> 26:03.810
<b><i>Wait!</i></b>

26:09.770 --> 26:10.360
<b><i>Can he fly?</i></b>

26:10.730 --> 26:12.650
<b><i>The Gravity Ether Gear.</i></b>

26:18.370 --> 26:19.660
<b><i>Open fire!</i></b>

26:27.170 --> 26:28.120
<b><i>Fall back!</i></b>

26:29.170 --> 26:29.750
<b><i>Master!</i></b>

26:35.550 --> 26:36.300
<b><i>A homing head?</i></b>

26:38.260 --> 26:38.840
<b><i>Oh no!</i></b>

26:40.220 --> 26:43.060
<b>Homura put on quite a show!</b>

26:43.850 --> 26:48.020
<b>That's what we call cutting to the chase!</b>

26:48.270 --> 26:50.060
<b><i>She cut the missile in two?</i></b>

26:53.900 --> 26:55.150
<b><i>That's my Ether Gear.</i></b>

26:56.280 --> 26:57.740
<b><i>Soul Blade!</i></b>

26:58.950 --> 27:00.740
<b><i>The Samourai is good!</i></b>

27:01.030 --> 27:04.160
<b><i>I prefer "knight," but I won't say it.</i></b>

27:04.910 --> 27:07.120
<b><i>Shiki, get Sister!</i></b>

27:07.790 --> 27:09.540
<b><i>I'll deal with these guys.</i></b>

27:13.590 --> 27:16.460
<b><i>Rebecca, we're counting on you.</i></b>

27:17.800 --> 27:19.630
<b><i>I'm almost there.</i></b>

27:21.090 --> 27:24.600
<b>Rebecca didn't wait for us to 
come to save her - nice job!</b>

27:25.020 --> 27:27.430
<b>She said she'd have got extra followers</b>

27:27.600 --> 27:30.980
<b>if she had put that on her channel.</b>

27:31.350 --> 27:32.480
<b>Positive thinking!</b>

27:32.940 --> 27:36.940
<b><i>We'll have some fun, until you go.</i></b>

27:40.320 --> 27:40.860
<b><i>Shiki!</i></b>

27:42.320 --> 27:43.120
<b><i>Croa!</i></b>

27:43.280 --> 27:45.830
<b><i>Ow! Ow! That hurts!</i></b>

27:46.330 --> 27:48.330
<b><i>You kidnapped my friend.</i></b>

27:49.250 --> 27:50.330
<b><i>Say your prayers.</i></b>

27:50.500 --> 27:53.380
<b>We thought we had rescued everyone, but...</b>

27:53.540 --> 27:54.880
<b>Jinn came!</b>

28:01.090 --> 28:02.930
<b><i>We meet again, Cosmic Ninja!</i></b>

28:03.350 --> 28:05.930
<b><i>I didn't think you'd come, really.</i></b>

28:06.310 --> 28:08.140
<b><i>Playtime is over.</i></b>

28:09.060 --> 28:10.350
<b><i>I'm going to kill you.</i></b>

28:10.980 --> 28:13.940
<b><i>That's right. The sparring is over.</i></b>

28:14.520 --> 28:16.860
<b><i>It's time for a real fight,</i></b>

28:17.360 --> 28:18.570
<b><i>to protect my friends!</i></b>

28:29.120 --> 28:30.710
<b><i>Your back was exposed.</i></b>

28:30.870 --> 28:32.790
<b>Weisz came running too.</b>

28:32.960 --> 28:34.920
<b>What an atmosphere!</b>

28:37.050 --> 28:37.880
<b><i>What's that?</i></b>

28:38.250 --> 28:42.130
<b><i>The Chronophage is heading toward Guilst!</i></b>

28:45.050 --> 28:46.600
<b><i>Skymech Ninjutsu Attack.</i></b>

28:48.810 --> 28:50.020
<b><i>Windstorm Slash!</i></b>

28:56.770 --> 28:58.150
<b><i>Magimech Attack.</i></b>

28:59.900 --> 29:01.110
<b><i>Gravity Wave.</i></b>

29:06.320 --> 29:09.700
<b>When the Chronophage got to Guilst,</b>

29:09.870 --> 29:11.500
<b>there was too much going on!</b>

29:11.660 --> 29:13.710
<b>And then Weisz and Homura</b>

29:14.080 --> 29:17.170
<b>found the real Sister, 
who had been kidnapped,</b>

29:17.340 --> 29:20.630
<b>so the Rogue Out Sister was a usurper.</b>

29:22.010 --> 29:23.380
<b><i>What's that noise?</i></b>

29:24.130 --> 29:26.390
<b><i>It's a reaction to the 
Ether, in the basement.</i></b>

29:28.010 --> 29:28.680
<b><i>Wow!</i></b>

29:29.180 --> 29:30.560
<b><i>What is it?</i></b>

29:31.680 --> 29:35.060
<b><i>There's no doubt, it's one 
of the Four Shining Stars.</i></b>

29:35.350 --> 29:36.690
<b><i>Sister Ivry!</i></b>

29:40.190 --> 29:43.530
<b>And at that point, the real Sister showed up</b>

29:43.700 --> 29:46.530
<b>and I have to say she's 
got a lot of character.</b>

29:47.160 --> 29:49.530
<b>I don't advise you</b>

29:49.700 --> 29:51.120
<b>to make comments</b>

29:51.290 --> 29:53.410
<b>about other people's character.</b>

29:53.580 --> 29:54.960
<b>What are you insinuating?</b>

29:56.750 --> 29:59.290
<b><i>You dared to make use of my powers.</i></b>

29:59.670 --> 30:02.630
<b><i>I'll pitch you into the Demon King's toilet.</i></b>

30:04.920 --> 30:07.430
<b><i>Sister Ivry...</i></b>

30:08.350 --> 30:09.970
<b><i>There are two Sisters?</i></b>

30:11.180 --> 30:13.390
<b><i>I finally woke up.</i></b>

30:14.230 --> 30:14.930
<b><i>And I realized</i></b>

30:15.190 --> 30:18.270
<b><i>that some fool had usurped my name</i></b>

30:18.440 --> 30:22.190
<b><i>and was using my powers, 
without my permission.</i></b>

30:22.650 --> 30:24.570
<b><i>That wasn't my intention.</i></b>

30:24.740 --> 30:26.860
<b><i>Please, you have to believe me!</i></b>

30:27.360 --> 30:30.200
<b><i>I revered you, as a goddess,</i></b>

30:30.660 --> 30:33.580
<b><i>a being capable of miracles.</i></b>

30:34.000 --> 30:35.580
<b><i>I couldn't care less!</i></b>

30:38.710 --> 30:40.340
<b><i>Dispel Driver!</i></b>

30:43.510 --> 30:45.090
<b><i>Where is that light coming from?</i></b>

30:50.220 --> 30:50.800
<b><i>Look!</i></b>

30:52.220 --> 30:53.560
<b><i>They're back to normal.</i></b>

30:56.180 --> 30:58.400
<b><i>Incredible. It's a miracle.</i></b>

31:03.150 --> 31:07.650
<b>Sister's powers restored 
the petrified girls.</b>

31:07.820 --> 31:09.780
<b>And the Chronophage?</b>

31:10.910 --> 31:13.620
<b><i>Just ten minutes before the 
Chronophage's arrival.</i></b>

31:13.790 --> 31:14.790
<b><i>Plenty of time!</i></b>

31:14.950 --> 31:16.540
<b><i>Are you kidding?</i></b>

31:16.750 --> 31:18.830
<b><i>Another new friend.</i></b>

31:19.000 --> 31:21.330
<b><i>I won't say, but she's cute.</i></b>

31:21.500 --> 31:24.380
<b><i>Are you ignoring the danger 
on purpose or what?</i></b>

31:26.380 --> 31:28.760
<b><i>Is that the effect of the Chronophage?</i></b>

31:29.010 --> 31:30.510
<b><i>Don't destroy the planet!</i></b>

31:30.840 --> 31:32.720
<b><i>The planet's Ether flow has reversed.</i></b>

31:34.970 --> 31:35.890
<b><i>Rebecca!</i></b>

31:37.770 --> 31:40.230
<b><i>Rebecca!</i></b>

31:40.900 --> 31:42.230
<b><i>Just in time!</i></b>

31:42.440 --> 31:44.020
<b><i>-Shiki! -Master!</i></b>

31:48.650 --> 31:51.320
<b><i>Look, there's Edens Zero!</i></b>

31:51.780 --> 31:52.870
<b>This is Edens Zero.</b>

31:53.320 --> 31:54.910
<b>We can't land on the trees.</b>

31:55.080 --> 31:57.450
<b>Demon King, is there anything you can do?</b>

31:58.160 --> 31:58.870
<b><i>That sword...</i></b>

32:00.750 --> 32:02.000
<b><i>Leopard Claw Frenzy!</i></b>

32:02.630 --> 32:04.090
<b><i>Atlas Flame!</i></b>

32:05.630 --> 32:08.050
<b><i>A flamethrower? Where did that come from?</i></b>

32:08.970 --> 32:10.470
<b><i>We're going to come!</i></b>

32:11.890 --> 32:13.260
<b><i>Hold on tight!</i></b>

32:13.760 --> 32:14.390
<b><i>Seriously?</i></b>

32:15.260 --> 32:18.100
<b>We got back to the ship, 
thanks to my Ether Gear.</b>

32:18.480 --> 32:20.850
<b>We just got out.</b>

32:21.440 --> 32:23.730
<b>-That really meant a lot. -It did?</b>

32:24.440 --> 32:27.980
<b>Your Ether Gear isn't jut for fighting.</b>

32:28.320 --> 32:31.950
<b>It can be used to save people too.</b>

32:32.320 --> 32:33.820
<b>That's true.</b>

32:33.990 --> 32:36.030
<b>You seem pleased with yourself.</b>

32:36.620 --> 32:39.290
<b><i>Your sword belongs to Valkyrie.</i></b>

32:40.080 --> 32:40.710
<b><i>Indeed.</i></b>

32:40.870 --> 32:43.250
<b><i>I don't know where Valkyrie is either.</i></b>

32:43.790 --> 32:46.170
<b><i>I'm looking for her too, actually.</i></b>

32:46.460 --> 32:48.840
<b><i>My master disappeared so suddenly.</i></b>

32:49.920 --> 32:50.550
<b><i>Master?</i></b>

32:50.970 --> 32:54.220
<b><i>I felt it, when you got your sword out.</i></b>

32:54.590 --> 32:56.470
<b><i>Valkyrie has a disciple.</i></b>

32:56.850 --> 33:00.770
<b><i>Now I understand why you were 
interested in Edens Zero.</i></b>

33:01.180 --> 33:05.560
<b>What a surprise to find out that 
Homura is a disciple of Valkyrie.</b>

33:05.730 --> 33:08.020
<b><i>Could I stay on board the ship?</i></b>

33:09.480 --> 33:10.070
<b><i>Okay.</i></b>

33:10.360 --> 33:13.820
<b><i>Should I conclude that you're 
accompanying Mr. Weisz?</i></b>

33:14.860 --> 33:19.660
<b>Homura joined the crew, to find Valkyrie.</b>

33:19.830 --> 33:21.080
<b><i>We're friends already.</i></b>

33:21.250 --> 33:23.540
<b>And Weisz joined us too.</b>

33:24.170 --> 33:27.920
<b><i>After all, I don't have 
any precise destination.</i></b>

33:28.800 --> 33:30.380
<b><i>I'll join you for a while.</i></b>

33:38.890 --> 33:39.560
<b><i>Mosco!</i></b>

33:39.720 --> 33:40.890
<b>A new brigand.</b>

33:41.220 --> 33:45.850
<b>Yes, Mosco, who the fake Sister brainwashed.</b>

33:46.020 --> 33:49.190
<b>He's back to normal and back on Edens Zero.</b>

33:49.820 --> 33:52.190
<b>I wonder what this button does.</b>

33:52.490 --> 33:56.030
<b>When it was time to set off again,</b>

33:56.320 --> 33:57.820
<b>on Iron Hill we saw...</b>

33:58.320 --> 34:01.040
<b>The heart of Edens Zero, Hermit.</b>

34:01.240 --> 34:03.120
<b><i>I see a human outline.</i></b>

34:03.750 --> 34:06.040
<b><i>I said I had various leads,</i></b>

34:06.210 --> 34:08.670
<b><i>but I didn't expect the 
first to be the right one.</i></b>

34:09.590 --> 34:13.010
<b><i>Can you read our thoughts, Hermit?</i></b>

34:14.880 --> 34:16.130
<b><i>Hermit?</i></b>

34:17.760 --> 34:18.390
<b><i>Immobile.</i></b>

34:18.970 --> 34:20.390
<b><i>And mute.</i></b>

34:21.180 --> 34:22.770
<b><i>What's wrong with her?</i></b>

34:23.140 --> 34:26.060
<b><i>There's no damage, but her 
system is full of errors.</i></b>

34:26.310 --> 34:28.440
<b><i>My Heal won't be enough.</i></b>

34:28.770 --> 34:29.520
<b><i>Hermit.</i></b>

34:29.690 --> 34:33.280
<b>Hermit had a broken heart.</b>

34:33.440 --> 34:35.400
<b>That's so sad!</b>

34:35.570 --> 34:37.410
<b>Master, are you still crying?</b>

34:39.320 --> 34:41.950
<b>There was a way to save her.</b>

34:42.160 --> 34:43.830
<b>To rescue Hermit's spirit,</b>

34:44.000 --> 34:47.620
<b>which was still deep in the 
virtual Planet Digitalis.</b>

34:47.790 --> 34:49.750
<b><i>Maybe we can save Hermit!</i></b>

34:50.130 --> 34:51.130
<b><i>Is she in "dive"?</i></b>

34:51.920 --> 34:53.710
<b><i>That means that her heart is...</i></b>

34:53.960 --> 34:55.510
<b><i>...on Planet Digitalis.</i></b>

34:56.010 --> 34:58.840
<b><i>We've got a good chance 
of finding her there.</i></b>

34:59.300 --> 35:00.390
<b><i>Digitalis?</i></b>

35:01.510 --> 35:06.060
<b><i>Digitalis is a virtual space, 
but also a real planet.</i></b>

35:06.390 --> 35:08.480
<b><i>One last warning:</i></b>

35:08.940 --> 35:12.770
<b><i>what you experience there 
will echo in reality.</i></b>

35:13.320 --> 35:15.030
<b><i>If you die in Digitalis...</i></b>

35:15.360 --> 35:16.780
<b><i>We understand the danger!</i></b>

35:17.030 --> 35:18.610
<b><i>Let's go to find Hermit!</i></b>

35:19.660 --> 35:21.120
<b><i>Connection to Digitalis.</i></b>

35:21.490 --> 35:24.490
<b><i>Activation of "dive," 
in the Digitalis world.</i></b>

35:24.660 --> 35:28.580
<b>We had to dive digitally 
into Planet Digitalis.</b>

35:28.960 --> 35:32.340
<b>-It was risky. -We had no choice.</b>

35:32.500 --> 35:33.750
<b>It was to save a friend.</b>

35:35.010 --> 35:38.050
<b>They spoiled the atmosphere, 
with their avatars.</b>

35:38.220 --> 35:38.970
<b>You too, master.</b>

35:40.050 --> 35:42.470
<b><i>To whom do I owe the honor?</i></b>

35:42.640 --> 35:43.810
<b><i>He's shaking too much!</i></b>

35:46.020 --> 35:47.980
<b><i>There's no reason you should know.</i></b>

35:48.350 --> 35:50.230
<b><i>I am the prince with no nation,</i></b>

35:50.560 --> 35:54.770
<b><i>a swordsman, leading his people, 
fighting for his country's rebirth.</i></b>

35:55.650 --> 35:57.190
<b><i>I hide that I am Homura.</i></b>

35:57.440 --> 35:59.150
<b><i>-Whoops! I said it! -Homura?</i></b>

35:59.610 --> 36:00.610
<b><i>It's me, Weisz !</i></b>

36:01.240 --> 36:02.660
<b><i>Or Weisz!</i></b>

36:02.870 --> 36:05.160
<b><i>Why did you choose to be a girl?</i></b>

36:06.040 --> 36:08.370
<b><i>Because I had the choice. Look!</i></b>

36:08.620 --> 36:10.670
<b><i>We can take a bath, as girls!</i></b>

36:10.830 --> 36:12.130
<b><i>You're still a man!</i></b>

36:12.500 --> 36:14.960
<b><i>I'm making a dream come true too.</i></b>

36:18.470 --> 36:19.760
<b><i>So pretty!</i></b>

36:20.180 --> 36:21.510
<b><i>Does this suit me?</i></b>

36:22.140 --> 36:23.090
<b><i>Really well!</i></b>

36:23.350 --> 36:25.760
<b><i>That's a full house then!</i></b>

36:26.220 --> 36:27.470
<b>But on Digitalis,</b>

36:27.640 --> 36:29.770
<b>we ran into some dangerous people.</b>

36:30.600 --> 36:31.350
<b><i>Stop!</i></b>

36:31.640 --> 36:34.980
<b><i>You can kill PNJs without 
getting me banished.</i></b>

36:35.480 --> 36:36.690
<b><i>I am Jamirov...</i></b>

36:36.860 --> 36:38.440
<b><i>an elect player.</i></b>

36:38.610 --> 36:41.320
<b><i>He's one of the Galaxy's Six Demon Generals.</i></b>

36:41.490 --> 36:43.780
<b><i>and a friend of Drakken Joe.</i></b>

36:44.320 --> 36:46.240
<b><i>-Drakken Joe? -Do you know who that is?</i></b>

36:46.870 --> 36:50.080
<b><i>He's one of the Galaxy's Six Demon Generals,</i></b>

36:50.250 --> 36:51.870
<b><i>capable of destroying stars.</i></b>

36:53.330 --> 36:54.210
<b><i>Oh my!</i></b>

36:54.710 --> 36:56.750
<b><i>Scary, huh?</i></b>

36:56.960 --> 36:59.670
<b><i>I love it when girls get 
that look on their faces!</i></b>

37:00.470 --> 37:02.760
<b><i>I don't care about your companions.</i></b>

37:03.390 --> 37:06.350
<b><i>I can't let this pass.</i></b>

37:06.810 --> 37:09.270
<b><i>Maria, my scythe...</i></b>

37:10.270 --> 37:12.310
<b><i>is famished!</i></b>

37:12.810 --> 37:13.440
<b><i>What's that?</i></b>

37:15.440 --> 37:16.610
<b><i>She became a monster?</i></b>

37:16.770 --> 37:17.440
<b><i>Shiki!</i></b>

37:18.360 --> 37:19.030
<b><i>Master!</i></b>

37:19.230 --> 37:21.740
<b><i>It's an invitation from Drakken Joe.</i></b>

37:22.650 --> 37:25.490
<b><i>We'll finish this later.</i></b>

37:26.780 --> 37:31.160
<b><i>Maria can't wait to hear 
you screaming in pain!</i></b>

37:35.500 --> 37:38.090
<b>When he disconnected, we 
finally found Hermit.</b>

37:38.500 --> 37:42.550
<b>She said she hated humans 
and refused to come back.</b>

37:42.970 --> 37:46.970
<b>We didn't know what had happened 
to her or what to do.</b>

37:47.140 --> 37:48.260
<b><i>Whatever,</i></b>

37:48.510 --> 37:50.600
<b><i>we've found you, Hermit.</i></b>

37:51.100 --> 37:52.680
<b><i>-Come with us, we'll... -No.</i></b>

37:53.810 --> 37:55.560
<b><i>Hermit, your body is already</i></b>

37:55.810 --> 37:57.650
<b><i>inside Edens Zero.</i></b>

37:57.980 --> 38:02.440
<b><i>What gave you the right to do 
that? Get back on Iron Hill.</i></b>

38:03.700 --> 38:05.610
<b><i>-Come on, let's go. -Get off me!</i></b>

38:06.030 --> 38:09.200
<b><i>You're the human that Ziggy 
brought back, right?</i></b>

38:10.240 --> 38:11.160
<b><i>I...</i></b>

38:12.040 --> 38:13.790
<b><i>hate humans.</i></b>

38:14.290 --> 38:16.880
<b>When she said she hated humans,</b>

38:17.040 --> 38:20.920
<b>I felt so sad.</b>

38:21.090 --> 38:24.340
<b>Can't we all be friends?</b>

38:24.630 --> 38:27.590
<b>Master, I recommend you don't cry.</b>

38:27.760 --> 38:29.640
<b>It's not good for the narrative.</b>

38:30.850 --> 38:31.390
<b>Okay...</b>

38:32.470 --> 38:35.020
<b><i>Is the infiltration going well, Sister?</i></b>

38:35.350 --> 38:36.190
<b><i>No problem.</i></b>

38:37.150 --> 38:39.110
<b><i>Shiki trusts me.</i></b>

38:41.940 --> 38:42.650
<b><i>What's that?</i></b>

38:42.860 --> 38:44.320
<b><i>A horde of monsters.</i></b>

38:44.530 --> 38:45.530
<b><i>And lots of them!</i></b>

38:45.700 --> 38:47.280
<b><i>They're coming for us!</i></b>

38:47.820 --> 38:49.370
<b><i>Danger level: incalculable.</i></b>

38:50.080 --> 38:51.080
<b><i>Oh my!</i></b>

38:51.870 --> 38:55.660
<b>On Jamirov's orders, the army 
of beasts invaded the town.</b>

38:55.830 --> 38:57.620
<b>The situation was really serious.</b>

38:58.080 --> 38:59.670
<b>It was intolerable.</b>

39:00.040 --> 39:04.170
<b>I saved Hermit, amid the chaos, 
but she didn't trust me.</b>

39:04.550 --> 39:05.920
<b>And Homura...</b>

39:06.260 --> 39:08.590
<b><i>Not all humans are bad.</i></b>

39:08.760 --> 39:10.350
<b><i>Humans have no heart.</i></b>

39:11.010 --> 39:12.890
<b><i>That's true of some of them.</i></b>

39:13.390 --> 39:16.140
<b><i>But you're a friend of 
my grandfather's, right?</i></b>

39:17.390 --> 39:19.270
<b><i>So you're my friend too.</i></b>

39:20.060 --> 39:22.610
<b><i>But now let's find the others.</i></b>

39:27.650 --> 39:28.410
<b><i>Homura...</i></b>

39:28.570 --> 39:31.320
<b><i>That girl is just a mass of data.</i></b>

39:31.490 --> 39:34.830
<b><i>I thought we were friends, Homura.</i></b>

39:35.000 --> 39:36.830
<b><i>I'm with Drakken Joe.</i></b>

39:37.250 --> 39:40.960
<b><i>Explanation: impossible. What 
happened to Valkyrie's quest?</i></b>

39:41.420 --> 39:43.460
<b><i>Did you believe that story?</i></b>

39:43.630 --> 39:44.340
<b><i>Homura...</i></b>

39:46.300 --> 39:47.970
<b><i>There are way too many of them!</i></b>

39:56.850 --> 39:58.350
<b><i>Are there two Homuras?</i></b>

39:58.850 --> 40:00.940
<b><i>Physically, she's that one, but...</i></b>

40:01.730 --> 40:03.230
<b><i>When I got here,</i></b>

40:03.610 --> 40:05.900
<b><i>I found myself in a cell.</i></b>

40:06.440 --> 40:08.070
<b><i>It took me a day</i></b>

40:08.360 --> 40:09.490
<b><i>to flee and come here.</i></b>

40:09.900 --> 40:11.530
<b><i>And what do I discover?</i></b>

40:11.870 --> 40:14.330
<b><i>Some wretch has usurped my identity.</i></b>

40:14.990 --> 40:17.620
<b><i>I'll never take on a man's appearance.</i></b>

40:18.160 --> 40:20.750
<b><i>Although... Out of curiosity...</i></b>

40:20.960 --> 40:22.080
<b><i>Er... no!</i></b>

40:22.460 --> 40:24.710
<b><i>Damn! I'm still thinking out loud.</i></b>

40:24.880 --> 40:26.050
<b><i>It looks like her.</i></b>

40:26.210 --> 40:30.590
<b>You must have been relieved 
that she didn't betray you.</b>

40:32.430 --> 40:34.180
<b>I always believed in her!</b>

40:34.350 --> 40:36.680
<b>I never doubted a friend.</b>

40:36.850 --> 40:40.940
<b>Shall we rewind a bit, to see your face?</b>

40:41.190 --> 40:42.850
<b>There's no point. Let's move on!</b>

40:43.310 --> 40:46.400
<b>Jamirov was cheating, 
with the Digitalis code,</b>

40:46.570 --> 40:48.860
<b>leaving us with no chance,</b>

40:49.190 --> 40:52.200
<b>but Hermit enabled us to turn things around.</b>

40:52.570 --> 40:54.870
<b>Thanks to her, we were 
able to trace Jamirov.</b>

40:55.740 --> 40:58.290
<b><i>I'll take care of it. I 
want to know who it is.</i></b>

40:58.750 --> 41:00.080
<b><i>Okay! Him...</i></b>

41:01.710 --> 41:02.750
<b><i>He's mine!</i></b>

41:06.590 --> 41:08.000
<b><i>Didn't that get to him?</i></b>

41:08.170 --> 41:09.630
<b><i>He's obviously cheating.</i></b>

41:09.800 --> 41:10.670
<b><i>He's cheating?</i></b>

41:10.840 --> 41:15.180
<b><i>He's messing with the planet's 
data, to get an advantage.</i></b>

41:15.800 --> 41:18.470
<b><i>So what do we do to beat him?</i></b>

41:18.720 --> 41:19.560
<b><i>Are you stupid?</i></b>

41:19.970 --> 41:22.270
<b><i>Just cheat yourselves.</i></b>

41:22.440 --> 41:23.440
<b><i>Who are you?</i></b>

41:23.980 --> 41:27.400
<b><i>I can copy people's appearance, 
personality and memory.</i></b>

41:27.770 --> 41:30.030
<b><i>But my mission failed.</i></b>

41:30.360 --> 41:31.900
<b><i>You should just disappear.</i></b>

41:32.450 --> 41:33.910
<b><i>I am Amira,</i></b>

41:34.200 --> 41:37.490
<b><i>an agent with the GIA - the 
Galactic Intelligence Agency.</i></b>

41:42.710 --> 41:43.330
<b><i>Incredible!</i></b>

41:43.960 --> 41:45.670
<b><i>Hitting it back at that distance,</i></b>

41:45.830 --> 41:47.460
<b><i>with such precision.</i></b>

41:48.840 --> 41:49.920
<b><i>Did she disappear?</i></b>

41:50.460 --> 41:53.800
<b><i>Programs are the best arms here.</i></b>

41:54.550 --> 41:55.970
<b><i>Anything's possible.</i></b>

41:56.390 --> 41:59.350
<b><i>First, I'll cancel his invincibility.</i></b>

42:00.020 --> 42:01.810
<b><i>Then I'll improve Shiki, as...</i></b>

42:03.770 --> 42:04.600
<b><i>a monster!</i></b>

42:06.810 --> 42:09.320
<b><i>Did you think you could 
beat me with a program?</i></b>

42:09.770 --> 42:11.070
<b>Hermit's spirit</b>

42:11.690 --> 42:14.110
<b>came back into her physical body, but...</b>

42:14.280 --> 42:15.700
<b>She's gone away.</b>

42:16.610 --> 42:19.370
<b>Jamirov, who you defeated on Digitalis,</b>

42:19.660 --> 42:22.290
<b>was actually Spider, the hacker,</b>

42:22.450 --> 42:24.250
<b>who hacked Edens Zero's system.</b>

42:24.410 --> 42:28.210
<b>He was as difficult real as he was virtual.</b>

42:28.630 --> 42:31.250
<b>I'm Spider, the great hacker.</b>

42:31.800 --> 42:32.380
<b><i>Who is it?</i></b>

42:32.550 --> 42:36.130
<b><i>If I said Jamirov, from Digitalis, 
would that ring a bell?</i></b>

42:36.380 --> 42:39.220
<b><i>What? He hacked Edens Zero?</i></b>

42:39.640 --> 42:42.220
<b><i>I'm already controlling your speed.</i></b>

42:47.060 --> 42:49.810
<b><i>In the situation, only Hermit could...</i></b>

42:49.980 --> 42:51.650
<b><i>Stop him?</i></b>

42:53.230 --> 42:55.490
<b><i>I'm not getting involved.</i></b>

42:55.740 --> 42:59.660
<b><i>I think that friendship is possible 
between men and machines.</i></b>

43:00.120 --> 43:03.660
<b><i>Giving way to sentimentalism 
is unworthy of a scientist.</i></b>

43:03.830 --> 43:06.000
<b><i>Not at all. I think it's admirable.</i></b>

43:06.160 --> 43:09.540
<b><i>We humans need your power.</i></b>

43:09.920 --> 43:12.880
<b><i>It'd be a pleasure, Prof. Muller!</i></b>

43:13.380 --> 43:16.050
<b>Hermit truly wanted to put her power</b>

43:16.220 --> 43:18.050
<b>in the service of humans</b>

43:18.760 --> 43:20.800
<b>and to become friends with them.</b>

43:21.760 --> 43:23.720
<b>She thought she had managed it.</b>

43:26.310 --> 43:29.310
<b>But they betrayed Hermit</b>

43:29.480 --> 43:32.230
<b>and broke her heart.</b>

43:32.400 --> 43:34.940
<b>This is Planet Hook. We have a problem!</b>

43:35.240 --> 43:39.240
<b>If the Ether Cannon catches 
fire, Hook will be destroyed!</b>

43:44.580 --> 43:47.410
<b><i>No!</i></b>

43:49.620 --> 43:50.420
<b><i>No.</i></b>

43:50.580 --> 43:52.170
<b><i>We did it!</i></b>

43:52.340 --> 43:53.290
<b><i>Hurray!</i></b>

43:54.920 --> 43:56.050
<b><i>What's...</i></b>

43:56.210 --> 43:58.340
<b><i>That's a weapon you built,</i></b>

43:58.630 --> 44:00.140
<b><i>an Ether Accelerator Cannon.</i></b>

44:00.720 --> 44:03.010
<b><i>You have a remarkable processor,</i></b>

44:03.180 --> 44:05.100
<b><i>which served us well.</i></b>

44:07.100 --> 44:08.140
<b><i>Smile.</i></b>

44:09.020 --> 44:11.520
<b><i>There we go. Good girl.</i></b>

44:11.690 --> 44:13.150
<b><i>That's good.</i></b>

44:13.400 --> 44:14.650
<b>It must've been hard.</b>

44:15.030 --> 44:17.070
<b>Hermit must've suffered so much.</b>

44:17.610 --> 44:20.950
<b>But your friendship for robots</b>

44:21.160 --> 44:24.160
<b>and Rebecca's and Homura's respect for them</b>

44:24.870 --> 44:28.460
<b>meant that Hermit's broken heart 
could be put back together.</b>

44:29.210 --> 44:32.960
<b><i>Shiki doesn't distinguish 
between humans and machines.</i></b>

44:33.790 --> 44:35.380
<b><i>He looks into their hearts.</i></b>

44:35.550 --> 44:37.420
<b><i>You can't understand</i></b>

44:37.920 --> 44:41.680
<b><i>what humans have put me through.</i></b>

44:41.930 --> 44:43.260
<b><i>No, we can't.</i></b>

44:43.430 --> 44:44.930
<b><i>Then leave me alone!</i></b>

44:45.100 --> 44:47.270
<b><i>-That's not possible. -Why not?</i></b>

44:47.640 --> 44:48.310
<b><i>Because</i></b>

44:48.810 --> 44:50.100
<b><i>you keep crying.</i></b>

44:51.230 --> 44:52.440
<b><i>That's surely because</i></b>

44:52.850 --> 44:55.980
<b><i>you know that humans aren't bad.</i></b>

44:56.190 --> 44:59.570
<b><i>But you can't trust us, right?</i></b>

44:59.900 --> 45:00.570
<b><i>In that case,</i></b>

45:01.280 --> 45:02.450
<b><i>believe in yourself.</i></b>

45:03.030 --> 45:05.370
<b><i>I'm staying here, because I believe in you.</i></b>

45:06.160 --> 45:08.370
<b><i>What do you want to do, Hermit?</i></b>

45:10.160 --> 45:11.250
<b><i>I want us...</i></b>

45:14.750 --> 45:16.000
<b><i>to be...</i></b>

45:17.210 --> 45:18.090
<b><i>friends...</i></b>

45:20.420 --> 45:23.470
<b>Because you hacked Edens 
Zero, you ought to know...</b>

45:25.850 --> 45:28.770
<b>it has a very long-range cannon</b>

45:28.930 --> 45:30.350
<b>and you're in its sights.</b>

45:33.350 --> 45:34.850
<b><i>That's just fireworks.</i></b>

45:37.440 --> 45:38.530
<b><i>I told you.</i></b>

45:39.110 --> 45:40.320
<b><i>Smiling suits her.</i></b>

45:40.900 --> 45:43.450
<b>Seeing her smile was a true joy.</b>

45:44.530 --> 45:47.160
<b><i>Three of the Four Shining 
Stars are together again.</i></b>

45:47.530 --> 45:49.160
<b><i>We just need one more.</i></b>

45:50.040 --> 45:51.870
<b><i>We need to find Valkyrie.</i></b>

45:52.120 --> 45:54.000
<b><i>Can't I replace her?</i></b>

45:54.170 --> 45:56.040
<b><i>Don't be ridiculous, you pig!</i></b>

45:56.540 --> 45:59.750
<b><i>I've give you a lot of 
headaches, but from now on,</i></b>

46:00.340 --> 46:02.630
<b><i>-I'll make it up. -Don't worry.</i></b>

46:03.050 --> 46:05.760
<b><i>Where could my master be?</i></b>

46:06.300 --> 46:09.810
<b>We had one Star left to 
find: Homura's Master,</b>

46:10.140 --> 46:12.810
<b>Valkyrie, Sword of Edens.</b>

46:13.100 --> 46:15.600
<b>But we had absolutely no leads.</b>

46:15.810 --> 46:18.020
<b><i>The legendary Sakura Cosmos fortune teller.</i></b>

46:18.520 --> 46:21.570
<b><i>Maybe she can tell us where Valkyrie is.</i></b>

46:21.900 --> 46:23.650
<b><i>A legendary fortune teller?</i></b>

46:23.820 --> 46:26.280
<b><i>I love it! That's so exciting!</i></b>

46:27.200 --> 46:29.990
<b><i>A fortune teller. They're not that reliable.</i></b>

46:30.160 --> 46:31.200
<b><i>She's different.</i></b>

46:31.750 --> 46:36.500
<b><i>She's a bitchin' fortune teller, who 
knows the past, present and future.</i></b>

46:36.670 --> 46:38.460
<b><i>Bad language detected.</i></b>

46:38.840 --> 46:41.630
<b><i>Where is she?</i></b>

46:42.590 --> 46:44.260
<b><i>On Mildian, the Planet of Time.</i></b>

46:44.800 --> 46:48.390
<b><i>A place where time has stopped.</i></b>

46:49.050 --> 46:53.810
<b>That's where Hermit remembered 
the legendary fortune teller.</b>

46:54.230 --> 46:57.690
<b>She was on Mildian, the Planet of Time.</b>

46:58.310 --> 47:01.070
<b>While we were on our way to Mildian,</b>

47:01.230 --> 47:03.990
<b>there was more turbulence.</b>

47:04.440 --> 47:05.820
<b>Edens Zero?</b>

47:06.450 --> 47:09.780
<b><i>They're so annoying. I 
hate them, those losers!</i></b>

47:10.700 --> 47:13.620
<b><i>And did those losers get the better of you?</i></b>

47:14.450 --> 47:16.460
<b><i>You give my name</i></b>

47:16.620 --> 47:18.380
<b><i>and come back, after a humiliation?</i></b>

47:20.250 --> 47:21.500
<b><i>This Edens Zero</i></b>

47:21.800 --> 47:24.630
<b><i>smells like money to me.</i></b>

47:25.550 --> 47:28.680
<b>But we're interested in finding Valkyrie.</b>

47:33.100 --> 47:34.140
<b><i>I'm hallucinating!</i></b>

47:34.640 --> 47:37.230
<b><i>The galaxy has no secrets from me.</i></b>

47:37.640 --> 47:39.770
<b><i>I am Xiaomei, the Time Oracle.</i></b>

47:40.190 --> 47:42.610
<b><i>Are you the legendary fortune teller?</i></b>

47:42.770 --> 47:45.610
<b><i>I don't tell fortunes. I read time.</i></b>

47:45.990 --> 47:48.320
<b><i>Good. I want to know where my master is.</i></b>

47:49.030 --> 47:51.280
<b><i>I already know, Homura.</i></b>

47:51.700 --> 47:53.080
<b><i>You know my name?</i></b>

47:53.240 --> 47:54.740
<b><i>And your companions'.</i></b>

47:55.290 --> 47:58.000
<b><i>Weisz. Shiki. Rebecca.</i></b>

47:58.460 --> 47:59.870
<b><i>Happy and Pino.</i></b>

48:00.040 --> 48:01.420
<b><i>How do you know that?</i></b>

48:01.790 --> 48:04.670
<b><i>I also knew the time and 
purpose of your visit.</i></b>

48:04.840 --> 48:07.630
<b><i>I told you, the galaxy 
has no secrets from me.</i></b>

48:08.050 --> 48:09.840
<b><i>-Seriously -That oracle is good.</i></b>

48:10.010 --> 48:12.550
<b><i>But I won't tell you without 
something in return.</i></b>

48:12.720 --> 48:14.260
<b><i>-What? -She's so stingy.</i></b>

48:16.560 --> 48:17.230
<b><i>What?</i></b>

48:17.480 --> 48:18.390
<b><i>The ground.</i></b>

48:28.820 --> 48:29.740
<b><i>Welcome...</i></b>

48:30.660 --> 48:33.580
<b><i>to the Mildian Colosseum.</i></b>

48:34.370 --> 48:38.370
<b><i>I know everything about the 
past, present and future.</i></b>

48:38.540 --> 48:40.460
<b><i>And that gets boring.</i></b>

48:41.000 --> 48:43.710
<b><i>So I put a limit on my power.</i></b>

48:44.040 --> 48:46.170
<b><i>That's the outcome of fights.</i></b>

48:46.500 --> 48:48.510
<b><i>The clash of bodies.</i></b>

48:48.800 --> 48:50.760
<b><i>I don't know who'll win.</i></b>

48:51.340 --> 48:53.050
<b><i>That's so good!</i></b>

48:53.300 --> 48:54.850
<b><i>She's unrecognizable.</i></b>

48:55.560 --> 48:58.520
<b><i>One of you will confront</i></b>

48:58.680 --> 49:00.520
<b><i>my warrior.</i></b>

49:00.810 --> 49:02.150
<b><i>It's for me to...</i></b>

49:02.310 --> 49:03.150
<b><i>I'll go.</i></b>

49:03.360 --> 49:06.190
<b>I didn't understand why a fight was needed</b>

49:06.360 --> 49:08.150
<b>to know where Valkyrie was.</b>

49:08.320 --> 49:12.360
<b>I didn't understand the change in Xiaomei.</b>

49:12.660 --> 49:14.450
<b><i>Ready? Fight!</i></b>

49:15.330 --> 49:17.950
<b><i>Come on!</i></b>

49:18.120 --> 49:21.460
<b>You made short work of the fight.</b>

49:21.620 --> 49:24.580
<b>Yes, and I thought we'd 
finally get our information.</b>

49:25.420 --> 49:28.170
<b>But I didn't really have 
a handle on Xiaomei.</b>

49:28.340 --> 49:31.590
<b>In the second round, Rebecca and Happy</b>

49:32.050 --> 49:34.260
<b>confronted Yocchi, the B-Cuber.</b>

49:34.430 --> 49:35.100
<b><i>Fight!</i></b>

49:36.350 --> 49:37.310
<b><i>That's slime.</i></b>

49:37.890 --> 49:39.520
<b><i>It devours all tissue!</i></b>

49:39.890 --> 49:42.690
<b><i>-What is this? -That's good!</i></b>

49:42.850 --> 49:44.150
<b><i>That's clickbait!</i></b>

49:44.310 --> 49:48.150
<b><i>Then you get a regular kick.</i></b>

49:48.400 --> 49:51.570
<b>I don't know why her clothes came apart.</b>

49:51.740 --> 49:53.240
<b>For sure.</b>

49:53.450 --> 49:56.660
<b>For the third round, I teamed up with Weisz.</b>

49:56.830 --> 49:58.740
<b><i>No one can catch me!</i></b>

49:58.910 --> 50:00.040
<b><i>Divine paws!</i></b>

50:00.200 --> 50:01.830
<b><i>Can I use a weapon?</i></b>

50:02.000 --> 50:05.540
<b><i>You're wasting your time! 
No weapon could catch me!</i></b>

50:05.920 --> 50:07.420
<b><i>EMP activated!</i></b>

50:10.170 --> 50:12.420
<b><i>-Take that! And that! -Hey, that's not fair!</i></b>

50:12.760 --> 50:15.550
<b><i>But you said I could use a weapon.</i></b>

50:15.890 --> 50:17.180
<b>Another victory.</b>

50:17.550 --> 50:19.310
<b>Homura took care of the last round.</b>

50:20.390 --> 50:22.890
<b><i>As I knew you'd come,</i></b>

50:23.060 --> 50:25.060
<b><i>I prepared her, especially.</i></b>

50:25.230 --> 50:28.230
<b><i>Valkyrie's response. One 
of the Four Shining Stars!</i></b>

50:28.900 --> 50:32.030
<b><i>A copy? That's an affront to my master!</i></b>

50:32.360 --> 50:34.280
<b><i>I know all about your sword.</i></b>

50:34.650 --> 50:35.160
<b><i>Silence!</i></b>

50:38.070 --> 50:38.830
<b><i>Your best foot.</i></b>

50:43.500 --> 50:46.830
<b><i>You've made no progress 
since last time, Homura.</i></b>

50:47.040 --> 50:48.210
<b><i>Can she beat her?</i></b>

50:48.540 --> 50:49.460
<b><i>Of course.</i></b>

50:50.340 --> 50:52.090
<b><i>Did you think I neglected it?</i></b>

50:52.260 --> 50:52.840
<b><i>Impossible!</i></b>

50:53.720 --> 50:55.220
<b><i>Warrior Maid Single-Sword!</i></b>

50:56.430 --> 50:57.680
<b><i>Dragon Flash!</i></b>

51:00.350 --> 51:04.060
<b><i>My master would never have 
been surprised by that trick.</i></b>

51:04.430 --> 51:05.810
<b><i>That's enough!</i></b>

51:06.520 --> 51:10.730
<b>Homura, who knew the strength 
of the real Valkyrie,</b>

51:10.900 --> 51:12.940
<b>finally won the day.</b>

51:13.110 --> 51:16.860
<b>And it was finally time to look 
for the last Shining Star.</b>

51:17.530 --> 51:21.240
<b><i>I see a planet, with light 
and shadow, side by side.</i></b>

51:21.410 --> 51:24.080
<b>Next stop: Planet Sun Jewel!</b>

51:24.580 --> 51:25.290
<b><i>Great!</i></b>

51:25.460 --> 51:27.670
<b><i>Those fish are from the Aoi Cosmos.</i></b>

51:27.830 --> 51:28.580
<b><i>The Aoi Cosmos?</i></b>

51:29.000 --> 51:30.710
<b><i>One of the external cosmoses.</i></b>

51:30.960 --> 51:33.880
<b><i>In short, it's full of fish.</i></b>

51:35.670 --> 51:36.630
<b><i>A human?</i></b>

51:36.840 --> 51:39.050
<b><i>What's he doing, with a wheel in his hands?</i></b>

51:39.430 --> 51:40.550
<b><i>He's looking at us.</i></b>

51:40.720 --> 51:42.180
<b><i>Activate the audio channel.</i></b>

51:43.600 --> 51:45.100
<b>Help.</b>

51:45.730 --> 51:49.270
<b>But on the way to Sun Jewel, 
we picked up a weird guy.</b>

51:50.440 --> 51:54.190
<b>Captain Connor came from the Aoi Cosmos,</b>

51:54.360 --> 51:56.070
<b>outside the Sakura Cosmos.</b>

51:56.530 --> 52:00.700
<b>He didn't inspire confidence 
in any of the Shining Stars.</b>

52:00.870 --> 52:01.990
<b>I didn't hate him.</b>

52:02.910 --> 52:06.040
<b><i>Thank you. I am Cpt. Connor,</i></b>

52:06.290 --> 52:08.210
<b><i>a ship captain, as you can see.</i></b>

52:08.370 --> 52:10.130
<b><i>I just see a wheel.</i></b>

52:10.330 --> 52:12.710
<b><i>I lost my ship, in a surreal incident.</i></b>

52:12.880 --> 52:14.550
<b><i>I don't know where it is.</i></b>

52:15.920 --> 52:17.970
<b><i>-Hey, old guy! -It's private in here.</i></b>

52:18.380 --> 52:19.300
<b><i>You rat!</i></b>

52:19.970 --> 52:22.430
<b><i>The boy told me your destination.</i></b>

52:22.680 --> 52:25.720
<b><i>A whole three days to get to Sun Jewel.</i></b>

52:25.890 --> 52:27.980
<b><i>I'd only need a day.</i></b>

52:29.850 --> 52:31.730
<b><i>And we've arrived.</i></b>

52:32.360 --> 52:36.070
<b>He was eccentric, but he 
proved his piloting skills,</b>

52:36.440 --> 52:38.650
<b>by taking us to Sun Jewel</b>

52:38.950 --> 52:40.700
<b>in one day, instead of three.</b>

52:41.410 --> 52:43.410
<b>Who exactly is he?</b>

52:44.030 --> 52:45.620
<b>He said he's a commander.</b>

52:45.790 --> 52:48.330
<b>A self-professed commander, I think.</b>

52:48.500 --> 52:51.420
<b><i>Now, I'm going to rest a while.</i></b>

52:51.580 --> 52:52.210
<b><i>One moment.</i></b>

52:52.670 --> 52:54.710
<b><i>Who actually are you?</i></b>

52:55.000 --> 52:57.170
<b><i>I'm a commander.</i></b>

52:58.630 --> 53:00.970
<b><i>What an incredible coincidence.</i></b>

53:01.380 --> 53:03.220
<b><i>Unless it's fate.</i></b>

53:03.680 --> 53:08.390
<b><i>Commander of a ship called Edens One.</i></b>

53:09.520 --> 53:10.310
<b>SUN JEWEL: THE PLANET OF GEMSTONES</b>

53:10.770 --> 53:11.520
<b>Incredible!</b>

53:11.770 --> 53:12.940
<b>It's so shiny!</b>

53:13.940 --> 53:17.610
<b>But Sun Jewel and its brilliance 
left me speechless.</b>

53:19.150 --> 53:21.570
<b><i>Everyone get down!</i></b>

53:21.780 --> 53:22.570
<b><i>Who's that?</i></b>

53:22.910 --> 53:25.280
<b>Then thieves showed up.</b>

53:25.450 --> 53:27.700
<b>That's when you showed your worth.</b>

53:28.120 --> 53:29.040
<b><i>Magimech Attack!</i></b>

53:30.330 --> 53:31.410
<b><i>Gravity Fist!</i></b>

53:33.120 --> 53:34.130
<b><i>Dirty kid!</i></b>

53:38.550 --> 53:41.380
<b><i>No crime is tolerated on our planet.</i></b>

53:42.800 --> 53:45.140
<b><i>-It's the Crimson Lady! -It's her!</i></b>

53:45.300 --> 53:46.350
<b><i>The Crimson Lady?</i></b>

53:46.550 --> 53:48.520
<b><i>No! I don't want to die!</i></b>

53:48.680 --> 53:51.730
<b><i>Let the criminals be punished... 
by the color red!</i></b>

53:54.600 --> 53:57.860
<b><i>Now we must judge the semi-criminals.</i></b>

53:58.150 --> 54:01.070
<b><i>Whatever the reason, all 
violence remains criminal.</i></b>

54:01.240 --> 54:02.740
<b><i>We sentence you</i></b>

54:02.900 --> 54:05.200
<b><i>to 100,000 metals!</i></b>

54:05.870 --> 54:07.490
<b><i>Shiki! Homura!</i></b>

54:07.830 --> 54:10.540
<b>Why were they punished?</b>

54:10.700 --> 54:11.710
<b><i>Oh no...</i></b>

54:11.870 --> 54:14.540
<b>So, who is this Crimson Lady?</b>

54:17.710 --> 54:18.380
<b><i>Where are we?</i></b>

54:20.010 --> 54:21.130
<b><i>Insects!</i></b>

54:21.800 --> 54:23.050
<b><i>And lots of them!</i></b>

54:23.220 --> 54:24.550
<b><i>Insects.</i></b>

54:24.720 --> 54:27.430
<b><i>Shiki! Get a grip! Unbelievable!</i></b>

54:35.230 --> 54:36.020
<b><i>Too many!</i></b>

54:36.810 --> 54:38.190
<b><i>-1 + 2... -...makes...</i></b>

54:38.610 --> 54:40.110
<b><i>a million powers!</i></b>

54:41.940 --> 54:43.740
<b><i>What's the news? Are you hurt?</i></b>

54:44.070 --> 54:45.030
<b><i>I don't get it.</i></b>

54:45.490 --> 54:47.870
<b>The Labor District, where we landed,</b>

54:48.700 --> 54:50.620
<b>was crawling with insects!</b>

54:50.790 --> 54:53.040
<b>And I hate insects!</b>

54:53.250 --> 54:55.750
<b>The criminals that end up there</b>

54:55.920 --> 54:59.710
<b>are forced to work, to extract metals,</b>

54:59.880 --> 55:02.130
<b>from an ore called Stones,</b>

55:02.300 --> 55:05.680
<b>to be sent to the Crimson Lady.</b>

55:06.630 --> 55:07.930
<b><i>First, get on your knees!</i></b>

55:10.140 --> 55:12.390
<b><i>Up close, you're really cute.</i></b>

55:17.770 --> 55:21.520
<b><i>You, follow me. I'll show you how to party.</i></b>

55:22.110 --> 55:23.570
<b><i>Scum.</i></b>

55:23.860 --> 55:24.860
<b><i>Don't do anything!</i></b>

55:25.860 --> 55:26.990
<b><i>I'll make him talk.</i></b>

55:27.280 --> 55:30.490
<b><i>He doesn't know that I 
can use the Ether Gear.</i></b>

55:30.700 --> 55:32.120
<b><i>I can hear you, you know.</i></b>

55:32.290 --> 55:35.080
<b><i>Damn! I was thinking aloud again.</i></b>

55:35.460 --> 55:39.170
<b>In this godless, lawless place, 
the monitors are kings.</b>

55:39.710 --> 55:42.250
<b>Yeah, that guy really wound me up...</b>

55:42.920 --> 55:44.050
<b><i>Dear viewers!</i></b>

55:44.300 --> 55:48.300
<b><i>This is Rebecca known 
for her nekoneko dance!</i></b>

55:49.300 --> 55:50.010
<b><i>Hello.</i></b>

55:50.430 --> 55:53.140
<b>This isn't really the time, but...</b>

55:53.560 --> 55:56.430
<b><i>You can get on stage, 
to do Ruby's responses.</i></b>

55:59.310 --> 56:01.400
<b><i>I'll melt your little heart.</i></b>

56:03.360 --> 56:04.480
<b><i>So cute!</i></b>

56:09.780 --> 56:11.990
<b><i>I told you, she's so funny!</i></b>

56:14.540 --> 56:16.790
<b><i>That wasn't in the script!</i></b>

56:16.960 --> 56:19.170
<b><i>Of course, that was a surprise.</i></b>

56:19.710 --> 56:24.050
<b><i>Stop making fun of my friend.</i></b>

56:26.050 --> 56:29.050
<b><i>I know how to get to the 
Labor District. Follow me.</i></b>

56:29.510 --> 56:31.720
<b><i>The anime will save the universe.</i></b>

56:31.890 --> 56:32.640
<b>On our side,</b>

56:32.850 --> 56:36.980
<b>Rebecca was humiliated by Laviria.</b>

56:37.270 --> 56:40.520
<b>They're all going for my friends!</b>

56:41.060 --> 56:41.900
<b>That's horrible!</b>

56:42.900 --> 56:44.770
<b><i>We'll take our sweet time.</i></b>

56:48.400 --> 56:49.030
<b><i>Shiki!</i></b>

56:49.450 --> 56:52.950
<b><i>If you rebel against me, everything 
that lives in the district...</i></b>

56:53.450 --> 56:55.240
<b><i>That's not my problem.</i></b>

56:55.540 --> 56:57.580
<b><i>My friends are more important.</i></b>

56:58.370 --> 57:00.460
<b><i>I'm no vigilante.</i></b>

57:01.120 --> 57:04.710
<b><i>If anyone touches my friends, I 
awaken the Demon King within me.</i></b>

57:07.460 --> 57:09.340
<b><i>Magimech Attack! Gravity Fist!</i></b>

57:13.010 --> 57:15.100
<b><i>I'd like to as him a few questions.</i></b>

57:15.560 --> 57:19.230
<b><i>I don't suppose you have any 
information about Valkyrie, but...</i></b>

57:20.690 --> 57:22.150
<b><i>Valkyrie?</i></b>

57:22.600 --> 57:24.360
<b><i>I know her very well.</i></b>

57:25.860 --> 57:30.450
<b>I didn't think that scum had 
any information about her.</b>

57:30.650 --> 57:34.450
<b>But we found some information, 
thanks to Paul,</b>

57:34.620 --> 57:37.450
<b>Valkyrie's disciple.</b>

57:37.620 --> 57:38.500
<b><i>Disciple?</i></b>

57:38.660 --> 57:41.500
<b><i>Here, in any case, I've never met Homura.</i></b>

57:41.670 --> 57:43.250
<b><i>Do you know Homura too?</i></b>

57:43.420 --> 57:46.000
<b><i>Of course. My master told me about her.</i></b>

57:46.540 --> 57:49.380
<b><i>The guardian can dispose 
of you as he sees fit.</i></b>

57:49.630 --> 57:52.630
<b><i>And send you into a ferocious Stones' lair.</i></b>

57:55.180 --> 57:56.930
<b><i>So, good bye.</i></b>

57:57.140 --> 57:59.100
<b><i>Wait! What about Valkyrie!</i></b>

58:03.810 --> 58:05.270
<b>But this Garrott</b>

58:05.610 --> 58:07.150
<b>never told us anything</b>

58:07.570 --> 58:11.440
<b>and sent us to Black Rock, the 
most powerful of the Stones.</b>

58:11.900 --> 58:12.740
<b><i>Forward!</i></b>

58:15.120 --> 58:16.120
<b><i>Magimech Attack!</i></b>

58:17.120 --> 58:17.990
<b><i>Gravity Fist!</i></b>

58:18.490 --> 58:21.330
<b><i>Warrior maid single-sword 
attack. snake strike!</i></b>

58:22.580 --> 58:24.830
<b><i>-What? -That hurts!</i></b>

58:31.090 --> 58:32.590
<b><i>That was really close!</i></b>

58:32.760 --> 58:34.550
<b><i>What's its body made of?</i></b>

58:37.220 --> 58:38.140
<b><i>That noise...</i></b>

58:38.510 --> 58:40.890
<b>No! More insects!</b>

58:41.060 --> 58:42.640
<b>A real crisis situation...</b>

58:42.810 --> 58:43.600
<b><i>Insects.</i></b>

58:45.270 --> 58:47.730
<b><i>There are too many of them!</i></b>

58:50.610 --> 58:51.900
<b><i>Were you kept waiting?</i></b>

58:52.820 --> 58:55.360
<b><i>I've always dreamed of saying that.</i></b>

58:55.610 --> 59:00.160
<b><i>It's covered in quartz scales, 
a very resistant ore.</i></b>

59:00.700 --> 59:03.410
<b><i>There's a small part of its 
back that seems less hard.</i></b>

59:03.660 --> 59:04.290
<b><i>Rebecca,</i></b>

59:04.460 --> 59:06.120
<b><i>get on my sword.</i></b>

59:06.500 --> 59:08.340
<b><i>Watch the landing.</i></b>

59:08.630 --> 59:09.840
<b><i>Fly with the elegance...</i></b>

59:11.340 --> 59:12.550
<b><i>of a princess!</i></b>

59:14.300 --> 59:15.130
<b><i>It's here!</i></b>

59:15.470 --> 59:16.590
<b><i>-Happy! -Yes!</i></b>

59:16.760 --> 59:18.260
<b><i>Ether Bullet Full Burst!</i></b>

59:21.850 --> 59:23.520
<b><i>Warrior Maid Single-Sword.</i></b>

59:25.350 --> 59:26.900
<b><i>Snake Bite!</i></b>

59:27.060 --> 59:29.310
<b>SNAKE BITE</b>

59:29.900 --> 59:33.490
<b>Rebecca and Homura defeated it, brilliantly.</b>

59:34.650 --> 59:35.950
<b>Then time came</b>

59:36.110 --> 59:38.820
<b>for Homura to learn the 
truth about Valkyrie.</b>

59:39.200 --> 59:42.790
<b>But the Crimson Lady put 
her plan into action.</b>

59:43.200 --> 59:47.960
<b><i>The Valkyrie clan was preparing 
another rebellion.</i></b>

59:48.500 --> 59:50.040
<b><i>I'll use the Crimson Eye</i></b>

59:50.340 --> 59:53.130
<b><i>to reduce the Labor District to nothing.</i></b>

59:57.720 --> 59:58.930
<b><i>You're never</i></b>

59:59.090 --> 1:00:00.510
<b><i>without that cuddly toy.</i></b>

1:00:00.930 --> 1:00:02.260
<b><i>Is it very valuable?</i></b>

1:00:02.560 --> 1:00:06.430
<b><i>I always keep it with me 
so my mother can find me.</i></b>

1:00:06.600 --> 1:00:09.270
<b>Valkyrie was her master</b>

1:00:09.440 --> 1:00:12.270
<b>and a surrogate mother.</b>

1:00:12.860 --> 1:00:14.070
<b>But Valkyrie thought</b>

1:00:14.360 --> 1:00:17.240
<b>she needed her real mother.</b>

1:00:17.700 --> 1:00:21.200
<b>That's why she went to 
find Homorua's mother,</b>

1:00:21.700 --> 1:00:22.780
<b>on Sun Jewel.</b>

1:00:23.580 --> 1:00:25.500
<b><i>Homura needs her mother.</i></b>

1:00:25.870 --> 1:00:27.250
<b><i>Tell me where she is.</i></b>

1:00:29.210 --> 1:00:32.210
<b><i>At last, I've found you, Kurenai Kôgetsu.</i></b>

1:00:32.500 --> 1:00:33.710
<b><i>My name is Valkyrie.</i></b>

1:00:33.960 --> 1:00:36.170
<b><i>I'm going to take you to your daughter.</i></b>

1:00:37.010 --> 1:00:41.220
<b><i>For as long as I wear this 
collar, I'll be like a slave.</i></b>

1:00:41.430 --> 1:00:44.470
<b><i>Paul, take off her collar.</i></b>

1:00:45.560 --> 1:00:48.270
<b><i>I'll take responsibility 
for paying your debts.</i></b>

1:00:48.810 --> 1:00:51.900
<b><i>Kurenai, accept. Go back to Homura.</i></b>

1:00:52.440 --> 1:00:53.980
<b><i>I'll be eternally grateful</i></b>

1:00:54.150 --> 1:00:56.820
<b><i>to you Valkyrie.</i></b>

1:00:56.990 --> 1:00:58.990
<b>She took her place as a prisoner.</b>

1:00:59.150 --> 1:01:01.780
<b>so she could get back to Homura.</b>

1:01:01.990 --> 1:01:05.490
<b>But Kurenai was the Crimson Lady.</b>

1:01:05.910 --> 1:01:07.950
<b>She chose a life of luxury,</b>

1:01:08.410 --> 1:01:10.250
<b>rather than seeing Homura again.</b>

1:01:13.380 --> 1:01:16.050
<b><i>The woman that took Baron Mordo's place.</i></b>

1:01:16.760 --> 1:01:19.130
<b><i>She's demanding even more metals.</i></b>

1:01:19.720 --> 1:01:21.010
<b><i>Kurenai!</i></b>

1:01:21.720 --> 1:01:23.890
<b><i>Connection to Valkyrie Armament System.</i></b>

1:01:24.470 --> 1:01:25.890
<b><i>Odin Strike!</i></b>

1:01:26.470 --> 1:01:30.690
<b><i>You're about to discover the power of 
what is called the Sword of Edens!</i></b>

1:01:53.330 --> 1:01:54.380
<b><i>Master...</i></b>

1:01:55.960 --> 1:01:58.920
<b><i>Master, it is I, Homura!</i></b>

1:01:59.090 --> 1:02:00.590
<b><i>Answer me!</i></b>

1:02:00.840 --> 1:02:01.970
<b><i>Please!</i></b>

1:02:03.090 --> 1:02:04.840
<b><i>Wake up!</i></b>

1:02:08.140 --> 1:02:10.810
<b>The Crimson Lady had excited the Stones.</b>

1:02:11.640 --> 1:02:13.060
<b>And Valkyrie intervened.</b>

1:02:13.440 --> 1:02:15.190
<b>When I think of Homura,</b>

1:02:15.810 --> 1:02:18.730
<b>it makes me terribly sad.</b>

1:02:22.070 --> 1:02:24.530
<b><i>Where is the Crimson Lady?</i></b>

1:02:24.820 --> 1:02:25.870
<b><i>Who are you?</i></b>

1:02:26.160 --> 1:02:27.120
<b><i>Is it you?</i></b>

1:02:27.450 --> 1:02:30.160
<b><i>I'm going to take you back to Homura!</i></b>

1:02:30.500 --> 1:02:33.160
<b><i>I'm sorry to tell you,</i></b>

1:02:33.330 --> 1:02:36.880
<b><i>but I have absolutely no 
interest in my daughter.</i></b>

1:02:37.500 --> 1:02:40.710
<b><i>I'll take you with me, after 
I've given you a beating.</i></b>

1:02:40.920 --> 1:02:43.510
<b><i>Ooh, you're so scary.</i></b>

1:02:57.480 --> 1:02:59.480
<b><i>What's going on? I'm falling!</i></b>

1:03:01.940 --> 1:03:04.030
<b><i>No! The Crimson Lady!</i></b>

1:03:04.400 --> 1:03:06.870
<b><i>You made Homura cry!</i></b>

1:03:09.620 --> 1:03:11.910
<b><i>Tears are good for the weak.</i></b>

1:03:12.580 --> 1:03:15.420
<b><i>The powerful are always smiling.</i></b>

1:03:16.000 --> 1:03:19.590
<b>She wanted to kill Valkyrie and 
destroy the Labor District.</b>

1:03:20.630 --> 1:03:23.630
<b>And she stole Homura's smile.</b>

1:03:24.220 --> 1:03:25.880
<b>She made my friend Homura cry.</b>

1:03:26.380 --> 1:03:29.600
<b>The Crimson Lady should've paid!</b>

1:03:29.760 --> 1:03:32.890
<b>The rebels of the Labor District rose up,</b>

1:03:33.430 --> 1:03:35.100
<b>but there was another danger.</b>

1:03:36.600 --> 1:03:37.940
<b><i>The Crimson Eye!</i></b>

1:03:38.560 --> 1:03:40.860
<b><i>Somebody hacked it!</i></b>

1:03:41.230 --> 1:03:43.030
<b><i>Impossible! Who is it?</i></b>

1:03:43.690 --> 1:03:46.400
<b><i>You've turned into a vulgar old thing.</i></b>

1:03:47.240 --> 1:03:51.370
<b><i>The time when you begged me to 
lend you money is long gone.</i></b>

1:03:52.080 --> 1:03:53.120
<b><i>Drakken...</i></b>

1:03:54.250 --> 1:03:56.250
<b><i>Send in the The Kurenai Dragoon!</i></b>

1:03:58.580 --> 1:04:00.000
<b><i>What is this thing?</i></b>

1:04:08.590 --> 1:04:10.850
<b><i>No rebellion.</i></b>

1:04:18.850 --> 1:04:22.480
<b><i>How can a simple search get so out of hand?</i></b>

1:04:23.020 --> 1:04:23.820
<b><i>Weisz!</i></b>

1:04:24.230 --> 1:04:24.820
<b><i>No.</i></b>

1:04:27.780 --> 1:04:28.610
<b><i>I am Arsenal!</i></b>

1:04:29.990 --> 1:04:32.780
<b><i>The Weapon-Clad Steel Warrior!</i></b>

1:04:33.240 --> 1:04:34.870
<b><i>You have Weisz's voice.</i></b>

1:04:35.500 --> 1:04:36.620
<b><i>I am Arsenal!</i></b>

1:04:37.330 --> 1:04:39.040
<b>That's great armor!</b>

1:04:39.330 --> 1:04:41.920
<b>Why doesn't Weisz use his own name?</b>

1:04:42.130 --> 1:04:43.880
<b>I don't know,</b>

1:04:44.050 --> 1:04:47.760
<b>but Witch says it's because he's a boy.</b>

1:04:47.970 --> 1:04:49.550
<b>Ten seconds till hibernate mode.</b>

1:04:50.680 --> 1:04:52.470
<b><i>Ten seconds is enough for me!</i></b>

1:04:56.140 --> 1:05:00.020
<b><i>You'll be the first line to write my legend!</i></b>

1:05:02.230 --> 1:05:05.820
<b><i>A legend that begins now!</i></b>

1:05:08.700 --> 1:05:11.240
<b><i>Metallica Explosion!</i></b>

1:05:11.700 --> 1:05:12.740
<b>METALLICA EXPLOSION</b>

1:05:18.000 --> 1:05:20.330
<b>Ether level: 0%.</b>

1:05:20.830 --> 1:05:22.670
<b>Total shutdown of Arsenal system.</b>

1:05:23.000 --> 1:05:26.840
<b>He defeated Baku, one of the 
Crimson Lady's Zeiten Three.</b>

1:05:27.760 --> 1:05:29.050
<b>So cool!</b>

1:05:29.220 --> 1:05:31.930
<b>Fantastic! I recognize Dr. Weisz there!</b>

1:05:32.340 --> 1:05:34.550
<b>Where are Shiki and Homura?</b>

1:05:35.760 --> 1:05:37.890
<b>And where are your clothes?</b>

1:05:38.520 --> 1:05:40.190
<b>The end wasn't so cool.</b>

1:05:43.270 --> 1:05:44.690
<b><i>Crush him!</i></b>

1:05:44.860 --> 1:05:48.030
<b><i>Reduce him to mush for me!</i></b>

1:05:48.690 --> 1:05:50.450
<b>I had my work cut out for me too.</b>

1:05:50.610 --> 1:05:53.660
<b>The Crimson Lady's secret 
weapon was superpowerful.</b>

1:05:53.950 --> 1:05:55.330
<b>The Kurenai Dragoon.</b>

1:05:55.490 --> 1:05:59.950
<b>His Ether Coating repelled 
your Ether Gear attacks.</b>

1:06:00.250 --> 1:06:04.420
<b><i>Okay, in that case, the 
ground needs to be heavier.</i></b>

1:06:09.380 --> 1:06:11.260
<b>Is that the Labor District?</b>

1:06:20.310 --> 1:06:23.810
<b><i>The booster is destroyed, but 
the main structure is intact.</i></b>

1:06:23.980 --> 1:06:25.400
<b><i>We're almost there.</i></b>

1:06:26.110 --> 1:06:28.190
<b><i>Homura is close by.</i></b>

1:06:28.480 --> 1:06:31.360
<b><i>Are you hoping for a touching reunion</i></b>

1:06:31.610 --> 1:06:35.530
<b>or to see a daughter unleash 
her anger on her mother?</b>

1:06:36.570 --> 1:06:38.740
<b>I couldn't care less.</b>

1:06:39.450 --> 1:06:42.620
<b><i>I'm accomplishing Valkyrie's last wishes!</i></b>

1:06:43.210 --> 1:06:45.080
<b>Rebecca confronted Nino,</b>

1:06:45.250 --> 1:06:47.340
<b>one of the Zeiten Three.</b>

1:06:47.630 --> 1:06:50.960
<b><i>I am Kenzaiten Nino and I'll deal with you.</i></b>

1:06:53.300 --> 1:06:53.930
<b><i>Take that!</i></b>

1:06:59.720 --> 1:07:01.180
<b>The pistol isn't working.</b>

1:07:04.230 --> 1:07:05.520
<b><i>Rebecca !</i></b>

1:07:06.190 --> 1:07:06.980
<b><i>My leg!</i></b>

1:07:09.520 --> 1:07:10.230
<b>Huh?</b>

1:07:10.940 --> 1:07:13.740
<b>It's like time is going backwards.</b>

1:07:16.160 --> 1:07:19.120
<b>My whole body's Ether is flowing to my leg.</b>

1:07:27.710 --> 1:07:29.750
<b><i>She leapt backward.</i></b>

1:07:31.920 --> 1:07:33.260
<b><i>The Ether Gear?</i></b>

1:07:39.640 --> 1:07:40.810
<b><i>Rebecca!</i></b>

1:07:40.970 --> 1:07:44.140
<b><i>Amazing? Since when did 
you master Ether Gear?</i></b>

1:07:44.480 --> 1:07:46.980
<b><i>The daily baths on Eden 
ended up by paying off.</i></b>

1:07:47.600 --> 1:07:50.440
<b><i>That jumping capability...</i></b>

1:07:50.610 --> 1:07:51.270
<b>LEAPER</b>

1:07:51.440 --> 1:07:52.980
<b><i>I'll call it "Leaper"!</i></b>

1:07:56.110 --> 1:07:59.490
<b><i>Where did all those swords come from?</i></b>

1:07:59.740 --> 1:08:03.160
<b><i>Warrior Maid Ultimate Attack: Odin Strike</i></b>

1:08:07.170 --> 1:08:08.830
<b><i>Bitch!</i></b>

1:08:10.460 --> 1:08:15.010
<b><i>My master's sword will 
judge people like you.</i></b>

1:08:15.260 --> 1:08:16.170
<b><i>Huh?</i></b>

1:08:16.930 --> 1:08:18.680
<b><i>Valkyrie's sword has disappeared.</i></b>

1:08:22.510 --> 1:08:24.270
<b>Rebecca defeated Nino,</b>

1:08:24.430 --> 1:08:28.480
<b>then Homura got rid of Garrot, 
the last of the Zaiten Three.</b>

1:08:28.650 --> 1:08:30.110
<b>What a great job!</b>

1:08:30.270 --> 1:08:33.570
<b>Master, focus on your fight!</b>

1:08:33.730 --> 1:08:34.820
<b>Ah, yes, right.</b>

1:08:35.030 --> 1:08:35.990
<b><i>Disperse!</i></b>

1:08:36.240 --> 1:08:37.200
<b><i>Queen Nova!</i></b>

1:08:37.740 --> 1:08:39.110
<b><i>Fire!</i></b>

1:08:42.240 --> 1:08:44.660
<b><i>Queen Nova never misses its target.</i></b>

1:08:45.160 --> 1:08:46.290
<b><i>Ah, right.</i></b>

1:08:47.790 --> 1:08:48.870
<b><i>And there?</i></b>

1:08:49.460 --> 1:08:50.750
<b><i>I won't run from him.</i></b>

1:08:52.090 --> 1:08:53.670
<b><i>I'll draw strength from him!</i></b>

1:08:56.170 --> 1:08:57.590
<b><i>Magimech Attack.</i></b>

1:08:58.300 --> 1:09:00.680
<b><i>Gravity Impact!</i></b>

1:09:00.970 --> 1:09:02.220
<b>MAGIMECH ATTACK GRAVITY IMPACT</b>

1:09:11.100 --> 1:09:16.030
<b>You used kinetic energy to 
destroy the Kurenai Dragoon.</b>

1:09:16.190 --> 1:09:17.610
<b>Quite a performance.</b>

1:09:17.780 --> 1:09:19.820
<b>Let's not get carried away.</b>

1:09:19.990 --> 1:09:22.160
<b>But, yes, it was pretty good, right?</b>

1:09:22.620 --> 1:09:24.990
<b>I detect further self-satisfaction.</b>

1:09:25.700 --> 1:09:29.910
<b><i>My master sought you, 
thinking I needed a mother.</i></b>

1:09:31.250 --> 1:09:31.960
<b><i>But...</i></b>

1:09:34.090 --> 1:09:35.840
<b><i>But for me,</i></b>

1:09:36.500 --> 1:09:40.180
<b><i>Valkyrie was the loving 
figure that I needed.</i></b>

1:09:41.510 --> 1:09:45.640
<b><i>Get out of my life, forever.</i></b>

1:09:46.100 --> 1:09:47.720
<b><i>That's all I wish of you.</i></b>

1:09:48.520 --> 1:09:51.190
<b><i>You are my master, my best friend</i></b>

1:09:52.560 --> 1:09:53.560
<b><i>and my mother.</i></b>

1:09:54.190 --> 1:09:57.400
<b><i>Thanks for all you've done for me, Mom.</i></b>

1:09:57.940 --> 1:10:02.910
<b>Homura saw Valkyrie as her true mother.</b>

1:10:04.620 --> 1:10:06.990
<b>Homura!</b>

1:10:07.290 --> 1:10:10.410
<b>Master, what a wonderful scene. Hold back.</b>

1:10:10.580 --> 1:10:11.410
<b>Okay...</b>

1:10:14.380 --> 1:10:16.420
<b><i>We have to accept</i></b>

1:10:16.920 --> 1:10:18.670
<b><i>the death of our friend.</i></b>

1:10:19.800 --> 1:10:21.420
<b><i>Shiki's right.</i></b>

1:10:22.930 --> 1:10:25.890
<b><i>If searchign for Mother 
as my master once did</i></b>

1:10:26.300 --> 1:10:28.560
<b><i>requires the Four Shining Stars,</i></b>

1:10:29.350 --> 1:10:32.310
<b><i>I will become Valkyrie.</i></b>

1:10:33.600 --> 1:10:37.520
<b>Homura then decided to walk 
in Valkyrie's footsteps.</b>

1:10:37.730 --> 1:10:40.900
<b>We've finally managed to reunite 
our Four Shining Stars.</b>

1:10:41.150 --> 1:10:41.650
<b>Yes.</b>

1:10:42.240 --> 1:10:46.620
<b><i>Grandfather, I've made 
loads of great friends.</i></b>

1:10:48.490 --> 1:10:49.620
<b><i>Isn't that great?</i></b>

1:10:50.160 --> 1:10:52.460
<b><i>I'll make a hundred friends, 
across the cosmos.</i></b>

1:10:53.080 --> 1:10:53.870
<b><i>Here we go!</i></b>

1:10:54.750 --> 1:10:56.540
<b><i>Next stop: Mother!</i></b>

1:10:56.710 --> 1:10:58.670
<b><i>Edens Zero, forward!</i></b>

1:10:59.300 --> 1:11:04.180
<b>Now our quest for Mother begins for real.</b>

1:11:04.590 --> 1:11:07.050
<b>With lots of friends.</b>

1:11:07.390 --> 1:11:08.140
<b>Yes!</b>

1:11:08.430 --> 1:11:10.640
<b><i>The boy and his friends 
begin their adventure.</i></b>

1:11:11.560 --> 1:11:14.640
<b><i>What role will they play in the universe?</i></b>

1:11:15.480 --> 1:11:18.690
<b><i>Will Shiki become the legendary hero?</i></b>

1:11:19.440 --> 1:11:22.610
<b><i>Or the Great Demon King?</i></b>

1:11:23.610 --> 1:11:26.490
<b><i>Let the adventure begin.</i></b>
